    # "Después de comer y de informar a [mar] y [nor] de la visita de Aaron, llevas a [eri] al trabajo."
    "After having lunch and informing [mar] and [nor] of Aaron's visit, you take [eri] to work."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1310
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_b1da6ddf:

    # eri "¿Sabes que le pasó a [dap] ayer?"
    eri "Do you know what happened to [dap] yesterday?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1311
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_9eed75b0:

    # mc "¿A qué te refieres?"
    mc "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1313
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_116c3eb6:

    # eri "Cuando volvimos de la playa, Scarlett nos dijo que estaba durmiendo. Ni siquiera se levantó para cenar."
    eri "When we got back from the beach, Scarlett told us she was sleeping. She didn't even get up for dinner."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1314
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_8e5a7abe:

    # mc "A lo mejor la playa le cansó mucho más de lo que ella esperaba. Yo también me quedé dormido en cuanto llegué."
    mc "Maybe the beach tired her out a lot more than she expected. I fell asleep as soon as I got home too."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1315
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_9a1f676b:

    # mc "¿Cuántos años llevabais sin ir?"
    mc "How many years have passed since you last went to the beach?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1317
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_739b9a9a:

    # eri "Todas preferimos la piscina, con lo que... es posible que hace dos veranos fuera la última vez que fuimos. Y tienes razón. Yo estaba agotada ayer, y estoy acostumbrada a estar de pie todo el día."
    eri "We all prefer the pool, so... it's possible that two summers ago was the last time I went. And you're right. I was exhausted yesterday, and I'm used to being on my feet all day."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1318
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_2c1d01dd:

    # mc "¿Ves? Nada de lo que preocuparse con [dap]."
    mc "See? No reason to worry about [dap]."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1322
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_e16745f7:

    # eri "¿Tengo que esperar alguna sorpresa más hoy?"
    eri "Do I have to expect any more surprises today?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1324
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_9eb8a604:

    # eri "El otro día, Alexia y Eileen. Ayer [emm]. ¿Algo para hoy?"
    eri "A few days ago, Alexia and Eileen. Yesterday, [emm]. Anything for today?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1326
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_7c7c37c6:

