    mc "What time do you get off work today?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1336
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_c6878542:

    # eri "A las 8 PM. ¿Por qué?"
    eri "At 8 PM. Why?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1337
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_c8a329a9:

    # mc "Es posible que pase a buscarte cuando salgas. A esa hora deberíamos estar volviendo de casa de Eileen. Hoy Solomon sale a cenar con amigos. O de copas. O algo."
    mc "I may pick you up when you finish work. We should be on our way back from Eileen's by that time. Solomon is going out to dinner with friends today. Or out for drinks. Or something."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1339
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_fd534d5e:

    # eri "Id con cuidado."
    eri "Take care."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1340
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_673ed1d8:

    # mc "Ayer hablé con Alexia y nos acompañará. Uniformada. Por lo que pueda ser. Pero Kiara dice que Solomon estará fuera hasta medianoche, con lo que, en principio, no hay peligro."
    mc "I spoke with Alexia yesterday and she will be joining us. In uniform. For what it may be. But Kiara says Solomon will be out until midnight, so, in theory, there's no danger."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1342
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_3a062587:

    # eri "Hablando de Eileen y Alexia. ¿Puedes llevar a Eileen de vuelta a casa? Acaba su turno ya y ella no te lo va a pedir..."
    eri "Speaking of Eileen and Alexia, can you take Eileen back home? She finishes her shift now and she's not going to ask you..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1343
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_bbbe904d:

    # mc "¿Por qué no me lo iba a pedir?"
    mc "Why wouldn't she ask me?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1345
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_c74ce6f8:

    # eri "Porque no quiere molestar. Ayer estaba diciendo que éramos mucha gente en casa y que daban más trabajo del necesario."
    eri "Because she doesn't want to bother you. Yesterday she was saying that there were already too many people at home and that they were creating more work than needed."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1346
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_eb3f3345:

    # eri "Ella no está segura del todo de que volver a casa, aunque sea esperando una semana, vaya a funcionar."
    eri "But, she's not entirely sure that going home, even after waiting for a week, is going to work either."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1347
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_fedcf671:

    # eri "Ayer por la noche estuvimos hablando en la piscina. Me dijo que, si tenían que volver a irse, le pediría una habitación a Alexia. O incluso irse antes."
    eri "Last night we were talking by the pool. She told me that, if they had to leave again, she would ask Alexia for a room. Or even leave earlier."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1348
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_877143b9:

    # mc "Aprovecharé el viaje de vuelta a casa para quitarle esas tonterías de la cabeza."
    mc "I'll use the trip home to get that nonsense out of her head."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1349
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_86f7c213:

    # "Pasáis el resto del trayecto hablando del día anterior en la playa. No vale la pena seguir hablando del tema hasta no hablar con Eileen."
    "You spend the rest of the ride talking about the day before on the beach. It's not worth talking about it any further until you talk to Eileen."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1351
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_4a21f2ad:

    # mc "Buenas tardes, Eileen. ¿Acabas ya tu turno?"
    mc "Good afternoon, Eileen. Have you finished your shift yet?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1352
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_d4a814c3:

    # eil "Hola, [eri] y [mc]. Sí, en dos minutos. Por fin. Ha sido un día de locos."
    eil "Hello, [eri] and [mc]. Almost, I'll finish in two minutes. Finally. It's been a crazy day."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1353
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_ed026424:

    # mc "Genial, entonces te llevo a casa, si quieres."
    mc "Great, then I'll give you a ride home, if you want."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1355
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_2699ad59:

    # eil "No hace falta que te molestes. No he tenido tiempo de comer nada y pensaba ir al Burger Prince a comer algo antes de volver. ¡Me muero de hambre!"
    eil "No need to bother yourself. I haven't had time to eat anything, and I was thinking of going to the Burger Prince to get something to eat before I go back home. I'm starving!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1356
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_5673d381:

    # mc "Pues si no te importa que te acompañe, al menos no comes sola. Yo ya he comido, pero sabes que los helados del Burger Prince siempre me han gustado."
    mc "Well, if you don't mind me tagging along, at least you're not eating alone. I already had lunch, but you know I've always liked the ice cream at Burger Prince."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1358
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_7b11548e:

    # eil "¡Perfecto!"
    eil "Great!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1361
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_2de0b1b2:

    # eil "Antes de ir a cambiarme quiero un beso."
    eil "Before I go to change, I want a kiss."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1362
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_636c88b5:

    # eil "¡Ahora vuelvo! ¡Me muero de hambre! *Risa*"
    eil "I'll be right back! I'm dying of hunger! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1364
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_645e5ca4:

    # eri "Bien jugado, [mc]. Mientras tiene la boca llena no puede discutir. *Risa*"
    eri "Well played, [mc]. While she has her mouth full, she can't argue. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1365
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_84402b53:

    # mc "Tampoco es que quiera discutir. Quiero hacerle saber que ni ella ni Kiara molestan en casa."
    mc "It's not that I want to argue, either. I just want to let her know that neither she nor Kiara are bothering us at home."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1366
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_26106c70:

    # eri "¿Quieres tomar algo mientras la esperas?"
    eri "Would you like something to drink while you wait for her?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1367
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_2af0b3ac:

    # mc "No gracias, tengo que mantener la línea. *Risa*"
    mc "No thanks, I have to control my weight. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1373
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_41d397cb:

    # "Unos minutos después..."
    "A few minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1377
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_85c55011:

    # eil "Ya estoy lista. ¿Nos vamos?"
    eil "I'm ready. Shall we go?"

