translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_00214848:

    # mc "Te recogemos cuando volvamos de casa de Eileen. Hasta luego."
    mc "We'll pick you up when we get back from Eileen's. See you later."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1386
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_ee01e3e3:

    # eri "Hasta luego."
    eri "See you later."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1389
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_f8a69689:

    # eil "Se me hace extraño verte besar a [eri] delante mío."
    eil "It feels strange to see you kissing [eri] in front of me."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1391
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_78357846:

    # mc "¿Te molesta? También te beso a ti delante de ella..."
    mc "Does it bother you? I kiss you in front of her too..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1393
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_afd7fcb9:

    # eil "No, me refiero a todo lo contrario. Cuando nos lo contamos, creía que iba a haber rivalidad entre nosotras compitiendo por ti."
    eil "No, I mean quite the opposite. When we told each other, I thought there was going to be a rivalry between the two of us, like we're competing for you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1394
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_a9e9418d:

    # eil "Pero ha sido justo lo contrario. Nos ha hecho más amigas todavía. Casi todos los días que nos coinciden turnos nos lo pasamos hablando de ti."
    eil "But it's been just the opposite. It's made us even closer as friends. Almost every day that we have overlapping shifts we spend time talking about you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1395
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_a21fdf91:

    # mc "*Risa* No sé si sentirme halagado o preocuparme."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't know whether to be flattered or worried."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1397
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_a4d94c1a:

    # eil "Nada de lo que preocuparte. Pero no sabía que me sentiría así con ella. Veo el bien que nos haces a las dos y no puedo evitar quererte más todavía."
    eil "Nothing to worry about. But I didn't know I would feel this way about her. I see the good you do us both and I can't help but love you even more."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1398
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_79ac9ab9:

    # mc "Si sigues así me voy a ruborizar. *Risa*"
    mc "If you keep this up, I'm going to blush. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1400
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_eff545a9:

    # mc "¿Te molesta? No quisiera que te sintieras incómoda..."
    mc "Does it bother you? I wouldn't want you to feel uncomfortable..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1402
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_dc05f0be:

    # eil "No, me refiero a que cuando descubrí lo vuestro, creía que me iba a importar más. Después acepté que mi momento había pasado y era el suyo."
    eil "No. I mean, when I found out about you guys, I thought I was going to care more. Then I accepted that my moment had passed, and it was yours."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1403
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_6e9418c3:

    # eil "Lo que se me hace raro es precisamente que no me moleste... Ahora hablamos de ti un montón."
    eil "What's weird is precisely that it doesn't bother me... Now we talk about you a lot."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1404
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_a21fdf91_1:

    # mc "*Risa* No sé si sentirme halagado o preocuparme."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't know whether to be flattered or worried."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1406
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_2bda1052:

    # eil "Nada de lo que preocuparte. Me pregunta sobre qué hacíamos cuando estábamos juntos y esas cosas."
    eil "Nothing to worry about. She asks me about what we were doing when we were together and stuff."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1407
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_e90a2cc6:

    # eil "Si puedo ayudar a que la relación entre mi ex-novio y una de mis mejores amigas prospere, no tenéis más que pedirlo. Aún te quiero, aunque sea solo como amigo."
    eil "If I can help the relationship between my ex-boyfriend and one of my best friends thrive, all you have to do is ask. I still love you, even if it's just as a friend."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1408
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_79ac9ab9_1:

    # mc "Si sigues así me voy a ruborizar. *Risa*"
    mc "If you keep this up I'm going to blush. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1410
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_52b34a58:

    # "Unos minutos después, ya en el Burger Prince..."
    "A few minutes later, already at the Burger Prince..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1411
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_adad4347:

    # eil "Si quieres puedes robarme UNA O DOS patatas. *Risa*"
    eil "If you want you can steal ONE OR TWO fries from my plate. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1412
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_a5075f5b:

    # mc "*Risa* No te preocupes. He comido mucho en casa y con el helado tengo de sobras. Además, la que me robaba patatas siempre eras tú."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't worry. I've eaten a lot at home and with the ice cream it's enough for me. Besides, the one stealing fries from me was always you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1413
translate english c15s003_PickUpEileen_3e91eda1:

    # eil "*Risa* Pero eso es porque estabas gordo y no quería que te engordaras más."
    eil "*Laugh* But that's because you were fat and I didn't want you to get any fatter."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1417
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_656360a7:

    # mc "¿Tienes ganas de volver a casa a por vuestras cosas?"
    mc "Do you feel like going home to get your stuff?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1418
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_e51ec80d:

    # eil "Sobre todo, tengo ganas de coger mi bici. No me gusta coger el bus o depender de vosotros para que me traigáis al trabajo o me llevéis a casa."
    eil "Mostly, I'm looking forward to taking my bike. I don't like taking the bus or depending on you guys to bring me to work or take me home."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1419
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_7e63b1b6:

    # mc "Sabes que no es ninguna molestia, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know it's no bother, right?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1421
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_48d5d8fe:

    # eil "No, no lo sé. Sé que lo decís y que os ofrecéis a hacer de taxista para todas nosotras, pero sé que es una molestia."
    eil "No, I don't know. I know you guys say that it isn't, and I know you're offering to be a cab driver for all of us, but I know it's a hassle."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1422
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_02e7aa1d:

    # eil "Vosotros tenéis cosas que hacer, una empresa que administrar. No podéis estar dejando de hacer vuestras cosas para llevarnos arriba o abajo."
    eil "You guys have things to do, a company to run. You can't stop doing your own things to shuttle us around."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1423
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_9e4e5a10:

    # mc "Eile, el dormitorio lo llevan entre [mar] y [nor]. Yo apenas hago nada. Si puedo ayudar haciendo que os sintáis más cómodas y llevándoos a los sitios, no es algo que me moleste hacer."
    mc "Eile, [mar] and [nor] run the Dorm. I hardly do anything. If I can help by making you guys feel more comfortable and taking you to places, it's not something I mind doing."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1425
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_7c0355d4:

    # eil "Pero es a eso a lo que me refiero. Que tengas que llevar a Kate o Lisa tiene cierta lógica. Son vuestras clientas, al fin y al cabo."
    eil "But that's what I mean. It's logical for you to taxi Kate or Lisa around. They are your customers, after all."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1426
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_add80054:

    # eil "Mi madre y yo somos poco más que una imposición. Nos hemos colado en vuestras vidas cuando más ocupados estáis."
    eil "My mother and I are little more than an imposition. We have intruded into your lives when you are at your busiest."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1427
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_e7332ea8:

    # mc "Y nosotros estamos contentos de que lo hayáis hecho."
    mc "And we're glad you did it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1429
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_a19f17e5:

    # eil "Al menos solo serán unos días antes de que os dejemos tranquilos."
    eil "At least it'll only be a few days before we leave you alone."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1430
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_6915ef1f:

    # eil "O volvemos a casa o buscamos otra solución la semana que viene."
    eil "Either we go back home, or we look for another solution next week."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1431
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_e72d62c5:

    # mc "O os quedáis en casa."
    mc "Or you stay at home."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1433
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_1d3d794a:

    # eil "Mejor no, he hablado con Alexia y, ahora que su abuelo se ha ido, podríamos usar su habitación."
    eil "Better not, I've talked to Alexia and, now that her grandfather is gone, we could use her spare room."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1434
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_d08a3786:

    # mc "Y en su casa no seríais una imposición por alguna razón que desconozco, ¿verdad?"
    mc "And at her apartment you wouldn't be an imposition for some reason I'm unaware of, would you?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1436
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_61c7262a:

    # eil "¡Claro que lo seríamos! Pero vive en la ciudad, seríamos más independientes para movernos."
    eil "Of course we would be! But she lives in the city, we would be more independent to move around."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1437
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_1fefb2e8:

    # eil "Y ella no tiene que atender a una familia, invitadas y clientas. Además, nos dejaría ayudarle en casa, cosa que ni [mar] ni [nor] hacen."
    eil "And she doesn't have to take care of a family, guests, and customers. Besides, she would let us help her at home, which neither [mar] or [nor] does."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1438
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_c8486eb7:

    # mc "Si es por eso, ya hablaré con ellas para que os dejen colaborar. Si os vais a sentir más a gusto..."
    mc "If that's why, I'll talk to them about letting you guys help out. If that’s what it takes to make you feel more comfortable..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1440
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_fcfea6cb:

    # eil "No es solo eso, [mc]. Son muchas cosas. Ayer, en la comida... "
    eil "It's not just that, [mc]. It's a lot of things. Yesterday, during the Christmas lunch..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1441
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_15b8e411:

    # mc "¿Qué pasó? ¿Alguien os hizo sentir mal?"
    mc "What happened? Did someone make you guys feel bad?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1442
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_de303d51:

    # eil "No, todo lo contrario... Hemos comido dos veces con tu familia... el día que llegamos y ayer..."
    eil "No, quite the opposite... We've had lunch twice with your family... the day we arrived and yesterday..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1443
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_40382aa3:

    # mc "Con nuestra familia..."
    mc "With our family..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1445
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_a8596415:

    # eil "¿Ves? Es a lo que me refiero... "
    eil "See? That's what I mean..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1446
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_ef117816:

    # eil "Yo sé cómo funciona tu... la familia... pero mi madre no. Anoche estaba excitada con el día de playa... tenías que haberla oído hablar..."
    eil "I know how your... the family works... but my mother doesn't. Last night she was excited about the beach day... you should have heard her talk..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1447
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_c84ea306:

    # mc "Pero eso es bueno, ¿no?"
    mc "But that's good, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1449
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_8516f971:

    # eil "No, no lo es. Después de descubrir cómo es una familia de verdad... vamos a tener que volver a casa... a nuestra familia... si es que se le puede llamar así."
    eil "No, it isn't. After finding out what a real family is like... we're going to have to go back home... to our family... if you can even call it that."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1450
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_3240139f:

    # eil "En casa mi madre tiene a su marido y yo a mi padre, pero mi madre está descubriendo que eso no nos convierte en familia."
    eil "At home my mother has her husband and I have my father, but my mother is discovering that doesn't necessarily make us a family."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1451
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_65d9ae89:

    # eil "Y solo llevamos dos días en casa de [nor]. Cuando haya pasado la semana, volver a casa va a ser deprimente para mi madre, una vez se acostumbre a los Marks."
    eil "And we've only been at [nor]'s house for two days. When the week has passed, returning home is going to be depressing for my mother, once she gets used to the Marks."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1452
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_9b663313:

    # mc "Y crees que, si os vais a casa de Alexia, la cosa va a ser diferente, ¿verdad?"
    mc "And you think, if you go to Alexia's house, it's going to be different, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1454
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_94ddbcc7:

    # eil "En cierto modo, sí. Los Marks sois fantásticos, pero podéis ser un poco abrumadores. Y con toda la familia volcada en nosotras por el momento que estamos atravesando..."
    eil "In a way, yes. You Marks are fantastic, but you can be a little overwhelming. And with the whole family pouring into us because of the time we're going through..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1455
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_03856f93:

    # mc "Eile, en la comida de ayer en el merendero, ¿quién estaba?"
    mc "Eile, who was there at yesterday's lunch at the picnic area?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1457
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_a088959b:

    # eil "La familia..."
    eil "The family..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1458
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_8a4eca21:

    # mc "Exacto. La familia. Nuestra familia. No solo los Marks. También estabais vosotras, las Lamb. Y las Washington, Samantha y Simone. Y las estudiantes. Y Alexia."
    mc "Exactly. Family. Our family. Not just the Marks. You, the Lambs, were there. And the Washingtons, Samantha and Simone. And the students. And Alexia."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1459
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_03715fd3:

    # mc "Y técnicamente mi Meemaw y Tía Betty no son Marks. *Risa*"
    mc "And technically my Meemaw and Aunt Betty are not Marks. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1460
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_280c1562:

    # mc "¿Estás diciendo que Alexia es menos familia que Samantha? ¿O que Debbie? ¿O que tú? Iros a casa de Alexia no os va a librar de la familia."
    mc "Are you saying Alexia is less family than Samantha? Or Debbie? Or you? Going to Alexia's house is not going to get you out of the family."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1462
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_5e84dd4b:

    # eil "Pero no es lo mismo... veros todos los días hace que nos demos cuenta de lo que no tenemos en nuestras vidas."
    eil "But it's not the same... seeing you every day makes us realize what we don't have in our lives."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1463
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_e323172a:

    # mc "Podéis tenerlo si queréis, pero no si huis de nosotros."
    mc "You can have it if you want it, but not if you run away from us."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1464
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_f0789d8b:

    # mc "[nor] ya os lo dijo. Podéis quedaros tanto tiempo como sea necesario."
    mc "[nor] already told you. You can stay as long as you need to."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1466
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_f6cb0b3b:

    # eil "Ya... mi madre está encantada... "
    eil "I know... my mother is delighted..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1467
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_ee0cfb56:

    # eil "Ya te digo que estaba muy excitada con la comida de ayer..."
    eil "I told you she was very excited about yesterday's lunch..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1470
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_b7277ef8:

    # eil "Y con algo que pasó antes y que no me ha querido contar..."
    eil "And about something that happened earlier that she didn't want to tell me about..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1471
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_3bcf4276:

    # mc "Bueno, pasó algo que la sorprendió, pero no es el momento de hablar de ello."
    mc "Well, something happened that surprised her, but this is not the right moment to talk about it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1472
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_bcbb23ec:

    # mc "Lo importante para mí es que estuvo totalmente integrada con el resto de la familia. Y, como tú dices, solo lleváis dos días en casa."
    mc "What's important to me is that she has become part of the family already. And, as you say, you've only been at home for two days."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1474
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_28a5bdc5:

    # eil "Y, como también he dicho, cuando pase la semana y tengamos que volver a casa, puede ser deprimente para ella. Parece que solo escuchas lo que quieres escuchar. *Risa*"
    eil "And, as I also said, when the week goes by and we have to go back to our home, it will be depressing for her. You seem to only hear what you want to hear. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1475
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_619087d4:

    # mc "Siempre buscando el lado bueno de la vida, ¿no? *Risa*"
    mc "Always looking on the bright side of life, aren't I? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1476
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_96c62fff:

    # mc "Pero no hacemos más que hablar de Kiara. ¿Cómo estás tú en casa?"
    mc "But we do nothing but talk about Kiara. How are you feeling at home?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1478
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_a74528bb:

    # eil "¿Cómo quieres que esté? Genial, tu familia... la familia... siempre me ha gustado. Vivirlo desde dentro es alucinante."
    eil "How do you want me to feel? Great! I've always loved your family... the family... Living it from the inside is mind-blowing."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1480
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_ba75ff18:

    # eil "Y saber que estamos juntos y que puede que un día también sea mi familia... mi familia de verdad... es increíble."
    eil "And knowing that we're together and that it might one day be my family too... my real family... it's amazing."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1482
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_480cda9a:

    # eil "Aunque saber que ya no estamos juntos y que nunca va a ser mi familia... mi familia de verdad... es un poco raro, pero no deja de ser increíble."
    eil "Even though knowing that we're not together anymore and it's never going to be my family... my real family... it's a little weird, but it's still amazing."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1483
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_29e1d82f:

    # mc "Ya es tu familia de verdad. Pregúntale a cualquiera de las chicas y verás que te ven como a una hermana o prima más."
    mc "It's already your real family. Ask any of the girls and you'll see that they see you as just another sister or cousin."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1485
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_4fc1f4b7:

    # eil "Lo sé... especialmente [emm] y [eri]..."
    eil "I know... especially [emm] and [eri]..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1486
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_b7ebfda9:

    # mc "Hablando de [emm]... tengo que pedirte un favor..."
    mc "Speaking of [emm]... I have to ask you a favor..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1487
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_0f7c3336:

    # eil "Dime..."
    eil "Tell me..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1488
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_11a7a1f9:

    # mc "¿Se te ocurre cómo puedo sacar de casa a [emm], [dap], Meemaw y Betty esta tarde? Necesitaría que estuvieran fuera de 5 a 6 de la tarde."
    mc "Can you think of a way I can get [emm], [dap], Meemaw and Betty out of the house this afternoon? I will need them to be out between 5 and 6 PM."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1490
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_4d128773:

    # eil "¿Puedo saber por qué o es otro de tus secretos?"
    eil "May I know why or is this another one of your secrets?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1491
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_215a602e:

    # mc "Vamos a recibir unas visitas por un tema de negocios. Y nos han pedido que estemos solo mi madre, [nor], y yo."
    mc "We're having some visitors for a business matter. And they've asked for just my mother, [nor], and myself to be there."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1493
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_dbd48779:

    # eil "¿No sería más lógico pedirles que no entren dónde sea que vayáis a tener la reunión?"
    eil "Wouldn't it make more sense to ask the girls not to go in whatever room the meeting will take place?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1494
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_a2c24c7c:

    # mc "Es más complicado que todo eso, Eile."
    mc "It's more complicated than that, Eile."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1496
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_de82b92e:

    # eil "No te preocupes. Ayer, hablando con Betty, me dijo que tenía que comprarse ropa. Olivia seguramente la querrá acompañar, y no será difícil convencer a [emm] y a [dap] para que vengan también."
    eil "Don't worry. Yesterday, while talking to Betty, she told me she had to buy some clothes. Olivia will probably want to accompany her, and it won't be hard to convince [emm] and [dap] to come along too."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1497
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_d0881f87:

    # eil "Si me dejas el coche, les puedo llevar a un par de tiendas de ropa y después ir a tomar algo para daros tiempo de que acabéis la reunión."
    eil "If you let me borrow your car, I can take them to a couple of clothing stores and then go for a drink to give you guys time to finish the meeting."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1498
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_5ff1fa81:

    # mc "Gracias, Eile."
    mc "Thank you, Eile."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1500
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_684e2887:

    # eil "No hay de qué. Para eso está la familia. *Risa*"
    eil "You're welcome. That's what family is for. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1501
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_ea034722:

    # eil "¿Voy al lavabo y nos vamos? Tengo que convencerlas de ir a comprar ropa... *Risa* ¿Qué tipo de ropa usa una monja en su tiempo libre?"
    eil "I'm going to the washroom and then we're leaving? I have to convince them to go shopping for clothes... *Laugh* What kind of clothes does a nun wear in her spare time?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1502
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_ad564295:

    # mc "No tengo ni idea, pero Betty parece vestir bastante normal. *Risa* Te espero aquí."
    mc "I have no idea, but Betty seems to dress pretty plain. *Laugh* I'll wait for you here."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1504
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_08c017ee:

    # "Te dispones a esperar a Eileen cuando oyes una conversación en una mesa a tu espalda."
    "You're about to wait for Eileen when you hear a conversation at a table behind you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1505
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_e32c891a:

    # "No puedes evitar escucharla. No habla alto, pero el local está prácticamente vacío."
    "You can't help but overhear it. The guy doesn't speak loudly, but the place is practically empty."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1506
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_1b99a9fd:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "... lo sé, hermanita, lo sé. Lo último que desearía sería hacerle daño..."
    "Man on the phone" "...I know, sis, I know. The last thing I'd want to do would be to hurt her..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1507
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_e025db26:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "No, no creo que sienta nada por mí ahora mismo, apenas nos conocemos. Yo nos definiría con amigos con posibilidades de llegar a algo más."
    "Man on the phone" "No, I don't think she has any feelings for me right now, we barely know each other. I would define us as friends with a chance of getting to something more."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1508
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_083722c9:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "Pero no consigo sentir nada por ella. Es una chica fantástica... deberías haberla visto el otro día..."
    "Man on the phone" "But I have no feelings for her, no matter how hard I try. She's a fantastic girl... you should have seen her the other day..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1509
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_79ee7506:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "Y sé que ahora me deberían gustar las chicas... pero no lo consigo..."
    "Man on the phone" "And I know I should like girls now... but I just can't manage to..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1510
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_2b0e9ace:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "Sí, también lo sé... ¿Soy raro, Olga?"
    "Man on the phone" "Yes, I know that too... Am I weird, Olga?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1511
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_2c9ed693:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "¡Qué fácil es para ti decirlo! Para hacerlo más complicado todavía, hace unos días conocí a un chico..."
    "Man on the phone" "How easy for you to say that! To make it even more complicated, I met a guy a few days ago..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1512
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_3e084095:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "No, no ha pasado nada... solo hemos hablado un par de veces... pero me atrae..."
    "Man on the phone" "No, nothing has happened... we've only talked a couple of times... but I'm attracted to him..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1513
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_0cfef5d5:

    # "La conversación se va alejando de ti, como si el hombre se estuviera marchando del Burger Prince."
    "The conversation is drifting away from you, as if the man is leaving the Burger Prince."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1514
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_1f2707f9:

    # "Hombre al teléfono" "Ser alguien como yo en una ciudad como esta... es complicado... Si estuviera en San Francisco contigo... sería diferente..."
    "Man on the phone" "Being someone like me in a city like this... it's complicated... If I were in San Francisco with you... it would be different..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1515
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_21a8671b:

    # "Empiezas a sentir curiosidad por saber quién está hablando. La voz te resulta familiar, pero no la ubicas."
    "You start to get curious about who's talking. The voice sounds familiar, but you can't place it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1520
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_6806f90f:

    # "Te giras justo a tiempo de ver como sale del restaurante mientras habla."
    "You turn around just in time to see him walk out of the restaurant as he speaks."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1521
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_25dcca5b:

    # mcp "(¿Ese es Anthony? No le he podido ver la cara, pero la voz...)"
    mcp "(Is that Anthony? I didn't get a look at his face, but the voice...)"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:1523
translate english c15s003_LunchEileen_c186e998:

