    eva "I think the meeting should start now... *Muttering* I can take a limited number of hugs."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2364
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5ec9c01b:

    # ama "Sí, empecemos ya o no va a dar tiempo de explicároslo todo."
    ama "Yes, let's start now or we won't have enough time to explain it all to you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2365
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_bbe94d2d:

    # mc "¿Os sentáis?"
    mc "Are you sitting down?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2366
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_82842932:

    # eva "Yo prefiero continuar de pie... para... para poder contrarrestar cualquier amenaza..."
    eva "I prefer to continue standing... to... to be able to counter any threat..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2368
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_17bf61a3:

    # nor "Siéntate al lado de Amanda, Eva, por favor. Yo me sentaré a tu lado."
    nor "Sit next to Amanda, Eva, please. I'll sit next to you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2369
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_1b44d8be:

    # eva "Mmmm... OK."
    eva "Mmmm... OK."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2371
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_1498326d:

    # mc "Explícanos, Aaron. ¿Qué es tan importante?"
    mc "You can start explaining it to us, Aaron. What's so important?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2372
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e51a58e2:

    # aar "¿Qué sabéis de NTR y de GILF?"
    aar "What do you know about NTR and GILF?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2374
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ba1749c2:

    # mc "Que fue fundada por mis tíos y que ahora, debido a un extraño testamento, somos prácticamente los dueños."
    mc "That it was founded by my uncles, and that now, due to a strange will, we are practically the owners."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2376
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ea3fd0d6:

    # mc "Que fue fundada por mi madre, mi tío y por Dominic Andersen. Y que ahora, debido a un extraño testamento, somos prácticamente los dueños."
    mc " That it was founded by my mother, my uncle, and Dominic Andersen. And that now, due to a strange will, we practically own it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2377
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_9fdc7264:

    # aar "Exacto. Prácticamente. Vuestra familia tiene el 75%% del accionariado. La mía el 25%% restante."
    aar "Exactly. Practically. Your family owns 75\% of the shares. Mine has the remaining 25\%."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2379
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_195d2a73:

    # nor "¿La tuya?"
    nor "Yours?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2380
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d17fb48f:

    # mc "¿Nos puedes explicar eso? Por lo que sé el 25%% restante lo heredaban la Serie XY-A y la Serie XX a partes iguales."
    mc "Can you explain that to us? As far as I know the remaining 25\% was inherited equally by Series XY-A and Series XX."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2381
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_4ef4cab8:

    # mc "Hemos descubierto que Eva y Amanda son XX. Pero tú no puedes ser Serie A."
    mc "We've discovered that Eva and Amanda are XX. But you can't be Series A."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2383
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d54ab48b:

    # ama "Quizás sería bueno que empezases por el principio, Aaron."
    ama "Perhaps it would be good for you to start from the beginning, Aaron."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2390
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_312d0efb:

    # mc "Es decir, somos los dueños de una empresa millonaria que se dedica a trabajar como mercenarios."
    mc "In other words, we are the owners of a million-dollar company that is engaged in mercenary work."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2391
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_a8337876:

    # aar "Sí, esa es la actividad económica principal. La secundaria es la investigación y diseño de dispositivos de medicina avanzada."
    aar "Yes, that's the primary economic activity. The secondary one is research and design of advanced medical devices."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2392
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_37a3d752:

    # mc "Vale, ¿y ahora qué?"
    mc "Okay, so what now?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2394
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_1f65be02:

    # aar "Ahora tenéis que tomar una decisión sobre qué queréis hacer con la empresa. Podéis venderla, mantenerla o cambiarla."
    aar "Now you have to make a decision about what you want to do with the company. You can sell it, keep it, or change it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2395
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8c794037:

    # aar "No hace falta que toméis la decisión ahora. Antes deberíais decirle la verdad a [emm], [dap] y [eri]. Ellas también tienen voto. Igual que nosotros."
    aar "You don't need to make the decision now. You should tell [emm], [dap] and [eri] the truth first. They have a vote too. So do we."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2397
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_34321809:

    # mc "¿Y mi padre?"
    mc "What about my father?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2399
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_dc7bae01:

    # aar "¿Tu padre? ¿Qué tiene que ver Edmund en todo esto?"
    aar "Your father? What's Edmund got to do with all this?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2400
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_1a9a442f:

    # mc "Le perseguíais... o le perseguían... aquí en Newport. Cuando se fugó también le persiguieron..."
    mc "You were chasing him... or they were chasing him... here in Newport. When he escaped they also chased him..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2402
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_541b2858:

    # mom "¿Qué? ¿Has estado en contacto con tu padre? ¿Has hablado con él?"
    mom "What? Have you been in contact with your father? Have you talked to him?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2403
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_dd2ee5e5:

    # mc "Sí, Mamá. Te lo explico luego."
    mc "Yes, Mom. I'll explain it to you later."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2405
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_79ef2db6:

    # aar "Tu padre no ha sido un objetivo nunca. No soy consciente de que nadie le haya seguido a ningún sitio o de que le estén vigilando."
    aar "Your father has never been a target. I'm not aware of anyone following him anywhere or watching him."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2406
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_52160b59:

    # mc "Vuestros Serie G le siguieron hasta Aruba..."
    mc "Your G-Series followed him to Aruba..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2408
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_cc928158:

    # aar "¿Aruba? *Risa* ¿Tu padre se fugó a Aruba?"
    aar "Aruba? *Laugh* Your father fled to Aruba?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2409
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5f18d335:

    # mc "Sí... no entiendo qué tiene de gracioso..."
    mc "Yeah... I don't understand what's so funny about it..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2411
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ecde917c:

    # aar "¿Te acuerdas que te he dicho que NTR compró laboratorios en el extranjero? El laboratorio principal está en Aruba."
    aar "Remember I told you that NTR bought labs overseas? The main lab is in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2412
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_4300af04:

    # aar "Nadie le vigilaba y nadie le siguió... *Risa* Fue él quien se metió en la boca del lobo..."
    aar "No one was watching him, and no one followed him.... *Laugh* It was he who went into the lion's den..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2413
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_628c5930:

    # aar "Si decidís mantener la empresa, uno de vosotros debería venir a Aruba con nosotros en unas semanas, una vez se calmen las aguas."
    aar "If you decide to keep the company, one of you should come to Aruba with us in a few weeks, once the waters calm down."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2414
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_65c4b1d4:

    # mc "¿Para qué?"
    mc "What for?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2416
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_3fd69b48:

    # aar "Ahora mismo la empresa está sin liderazgo. Con Xabier apartado de su puesto, GILF desaparecerá y todo el personal será absorbido por NTR."
    aar "Right now the company is without leadership. With Xabier removed from his position, GILF will disappear and all the staff will be absorbed by NTR."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2417
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_0d720591:

    # aar "Alguien debe dirigir ese cambio y decidir el rumbo que queréis... queremos darle a la empresa, sea para mantenerlo o cambiarlo."
    aar "Someone has to lead that change and decide the direction you want... we want to take the company, whether it's to keep it or change it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2418
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_074dd798:

    # mc "Ninguno de nosotros sabe nada de operaciones encubiertas, clonación, o medicina..."
    mc "None of us know anything about covert operations, cloning, or medicine..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2420
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5b630dd0:

    # nor "Pero tú sabes cómo dirigir una empresa. Es lo que has estudiado."
    nor "But you know how to run a company. It's what you've studied for."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2421
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_2c5471cc:

    # mc "Tú también... y yo solo he estudiado. No tendría ni idea de por dónde empezar..."
    mc "You too... and I've only studied. I wouldn't have a clue where to start..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2422
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_40badfe1:

    # nor "Yo sufro para administrar el Dormitorio... estoy demasiado oxidada..."
    nor "I struggle to manage the Dorm... I'm too rusty..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2424
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_12742e75:

    # aar "Yo podría ayudarte en eso... si quieres."
    aar "I could help you with that... if you want."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2425
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_de7691c5:

    # mc "¿Y por qué no la diriges tú? También eres accionista..."
    mc "And why don't you run it? You're also a shareholder..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2426
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8ed5b5bb:

    # aar "Hay demasiada mala sangre ahora mismo como para que yo tome el poder. Además, tu familia tiene la mayoría de las acciones..."
    aar "There's too much bad blood right now for me to take control. Besides, your family has the majority of the shares..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2427
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8b1f69e9:

    # aar "Puedo dirigir el proceso de transición, pero no puedo hacerme cargo de la empresa."
    aar "I can lead the transition process, but I can't take over the company."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2428
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_2a5a1ac4:

    # mc "¿Y Amanda y Eva?"
    mc "And what about Amanda and Eva?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2430
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d77a0a89:

    # ama "Si tú no sabes por dónde empezar, imagínate nosotras... y estamos en la misma posición que Aaron. Hay gente que no lo aceptaría. Volveremos a la base hoy con Aaron para allanarte el camino."
    ama "If you don't know where to start, imagine us... and we're in the same position as Aaron. There are people who wouldn't accept it. We'll go back to the base today with Aaron to smooth the way for you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2431
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_51bbbf53:

    # ama "Además, sólo serían unos meses. Una vez toméis la decisión sobre qué hacer con la empresa, una vez aprendas en quién puedes delegar, podrás dirigirlo todo desde aquí."
    ama "Besides, it would only be a few months. Once you make the decision on what to do with the company, once you learn who you can delegate to, you can run everything from here."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2432
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ce7ece0f:

    # mc "¿Meses? ¡No puedo irme meses!"
    mc "Months? I can't go away for months!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2434
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_0f161008:

    # eva "¿No te puedes separar de tu familia? Si decidís mantener la empresa y no venderla, sabes que es lo mejor."
    eva "Can't you separate yourself from your family? If you decide to keep the company and not sell it, you know it's the best thing to do."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2435
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_47f99024:

    # eva "Ayer se te llenaba la boca con la palabra familia. Hoy parece que no estás dispuesto a sacrificar unos meses por su bien."
    eva "Yesterday you had your big mouth full about family. Today you seem unwilling to sacrifice a few months for their sake."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2436
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_bfbfe313:

    # mc "Espera... ¿tenemos la oportunidad de venderla? ¿Hay compradores? ¿Qué valor tiene?"
    mc "Wait... Do we have a chance to sell it? Are there buyers? What's it worth?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2438
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_f00a197d:

    # aar "No hemos calculado el valor todavía. Pero bastante. Seguramente diez u once cifras. No creíamos que quisierais poner en venta la empresa familiar."
    aar "We haven't calculated the value yet. But quite a lot. Probably ten or eleven figures. We didn't think you'd want to put the family business up for sale."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2439
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d8922672:

    # mc "¡Wow! Es para pensarlo..."
    mc "Wow! It's food for thought..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2441
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_c3e497ce:

    # aar "Es posible que en las próximas semanas os hagan alguna oferta. Va a ser difícil que vuestra identidad no se filtre en algunos círculos."
    aar "It's possible that in the next few weeks you will get an offer. It's going to be difficult for your identity not to leak out in some circles."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2442
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_cd53b7f0:

    # aar "Si decidís venderla, nos gustaría pediros un favor. Dadnos la oportunidad de comprar vuestra parte."
    aar "If you decide to sell it, we would like to ask you a favor. Give us the opportunity to buy your shares."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2443
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8120dd94:

    # aar "O al menos lo suficiente para tener el control de la empresa. No queremos que caiga en manos equivocadas."
    aar "Or at least to buy enough to have control over the company. We don't want it to fall into the wrong hands."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2445
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ccb7b165:

    # nor "De momento me parecería buena idea no venderla hasta no saber más, y si decidimos hacerlo, creo que os debemos el derecho de tanteo."
    nor "At this point, I think it would be a good idea not to sell it until we know more, and if we decide to do so, I think we owe you the right of first dibs."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2446
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_53fef2fa:

    # "En ese momento te das cuenta de que [nor] y [mar] han estado usando sus teléfonos los últimos minutos. Estabas demasiado concentrado en la conversación para notarlo."
    "In that moment you realize that [nor] and [mar] have been using their phones for the last few minutes. You were too focused on the conversation to notice."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2447
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_bf424847:

    # nor "Pero nosotras también queremos algo a cambio. Al menos hasta que [mc] decida si va a Aruba en unas semanas."
    nor "But we also want something in return. At least, until [mc] decides whether to go to Aruba in a few weeks."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2449
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_1b61ee21:

    # mom "Queremos que Amanda y Eva se queden en Newport durante ese tiempo."
    mom "We want Amanda and Eva to stay in Newport during that time."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2450
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_eb701fd5:

    # "Y ahora entiendes qué hacían con los teléfonos. Estaban creando su propia estrategia de negociación."
    "And now you understand what they were doing with the phones. They were setting up their own negotiating strategy."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2452
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_7c4d48bc:

    # ama "¡Sí!... Digo... ¿Qué?" (multiple=2)
    ama "Yes!... I mean... What?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2453
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_f537aa30:

    # eva "¿Por qué nosotras?" (multiple=2)
    eva "Why us?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2455
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ec319464:

    # aar "Eso no va a ser posible..."
    aar "That will not be possible..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2457
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_2e543abb:

    # mom "Aaron, déjame hablar."
    mom "Aaron, let me talk."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2458
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_791a3641:

    # mom "Queremos que se queden por varias razones. La primera es que queremos conocerlas mejor."
    mom "We want them to stay for several reasons. The first is that we want to get to know them better."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2460
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_05ac2f66:

    # mom "También queremos que conozcan a las chicas. Creemos que las cinco tienen el derecho a conocerse."
    mom "We also want them to meet the girls. We believe all five of them have the right to meet each other."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2462
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e8fbeb86:

    # nor "Habrá que dar muchas explicaciones... pero..."
    nor "There will be a lot of explaining to do... but..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2463
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_a1007f8f:

    # nor "Queremos que pasen tiempo en casa una vez se lo hayamos contado a las chicas. Una comida o una cena cada día. Se pueden turnar."
    nor "We want them to spend time at home once we've told the girls. A lunch or dinner each day. They can take turns, if it's needed."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2464
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_9c03d934:

    # nor "Obviamente, solo si ellas quieren. Así podrán conocer a toda la familia."
    nor "Obviously, only if they want to. That way they can meet the whole family."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2466
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_2b800b5f:

    # nor "Nos habéis dicho que hay agentes a los que todavía no les habéis cancelado las órdenes, y no creemos que haya nadie mejor para protegernos."
    nor "You have told us that there are agents whose orders have not yet been canceled, and we don't think there is anyone better to protect us."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2468
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5c76298d:

    # aar "Eso va a ser muy complicado, no podemos..."
    aar "That's going to be very challenging, we can't..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2469
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8ac0354b:

    # mc "Creo que tienes la batalla perdida, Aaron."
    mc "I think you've lost the battle, Aaron."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2470
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_f3cfad35:

    # mc "Yo también tengo un par de condiciones si queréis el derecho a tanteo. Serían tres, pero con una se me han adelantado."
    mc "I also have a couple of conditions if you want the right of first dibs. It would be three, but [mar] and [nor] were faster with the first one."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2472
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ab7b8520:

    # ama "¿Qué condiciones, [mc]?"
    ama "What conditions, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2473
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5525bc3c:

    # mc "Quiero que me enseñéis a disparar. No quiero volver a sentirme tan indefenso como me sentí con Eric el otro día."
    mc "I want you to teach me how to shoot. I never want to feel as helpless as I felt with Eric the other day again."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2474
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_307728bf:

    # mc "Y quiero que me enseñen Eva y Amanda, con lo que la condición de que se queden es indispensable."
    mc "And I want Eva and Amanda to teach me, so the condition that they stay is indispensable."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2476
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e4d66cae:

    # eva "¡De eso me ocupo yo!... Si no le importa a Amanda..."
    eva "I'll take care of that!.... If Amanda doesn't mind..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2477
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_afe403e9:

    # mc "Y quiero que retiréis las cámaras de los espacios privados de la casa. Habitaciones, baños..."
    mc "And I want you to remove the cameras from the private areas of the house. Bedrooms, bathrooms..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2479
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_b16d4240:

    # mom "¿De qué estás hablando?" (multiple=2)
    mom "What are you talking about?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2480
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_9dae3966:

    # nor "¿Nos han grabado en las habitaciones?" (multiple=2)
    nor "Have we been recorded in the rooms?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2481
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5f14fd9d:

    # mc "Sí, y eso se acaba hoy."
    mc "Yes, and that ends today."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2483
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_c3c94543:

    # ama "Eso va a hacer más complicado protegeros. Si se infiltra alguien y no sabemos dónde está..."
    ama "That's going to make it harder to protect you guys. If someone infiltrates the house and we don't know where they are..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2484
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_54f928f5:

    # mc "Podéis revisar los pasillos y las zonas comunes. Pero se acabó grabarnos... durmiendo o duchándonos."
    mc "You can check the hallways and common areas. But no more filming us... sleeping or showering."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2486
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_a37e3844:

    # eva "Vale... no me gusta la idea, pero lo entiendo..."
    eva "Okay... I don't like the idea, but I understand your point..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2487
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e06f882a:

    # mc "Perfecto. ¿Mañana empezamos las lecciones sobre armas de fuego?"
    mc "Perfect. Can we start the firearms lessons tomorrow?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2489
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_c6eb1aae:

    # eva "¡Sí!"
    eva "Yes!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2491
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_a48835b3:

    # eva "Digo... sí. Ya que es tu condición, podemos hacerlo a mediodía si te va bien. En el lago."
    eva "I mean... yes. Since it's your condition, we can do it at noon if that's okay with you. At the lake you usually go running at."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2492
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_2a22efe0:

    # mc "Genial. Entonces todo está aclarado."
    mc "Great. Then everything is settled."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2494
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_3884d4c1:

    # aar "Nosotros nos vamos a tener que ir ya. Nuestro... mi vuelo sale en menos de dos horas."
    aar "We're going to have to leave now. Our... my flight leaves in less than two hours."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2520
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e78b50ef:

    # eva "¡Mierda! ¡Me he dejado la caja en el coche!"
    eva "Shit! I left the box in the car!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2521
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ee341e90:

    # mc "¿Qué caja?"
    mc "Which box?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2522
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_b662f280:

    # eva "Dame las llaves del garaje y ahora la traigo... que te lo vaya explicando Aaron..."
    eva "Give me the keys to the garage and I'll bring it here... I'll let Aaron explain it to you..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2523
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_059dc465:

    # mc "Tranquila, cuando os acompañe al coche la cogeré yo. ¿Qué es?"
    mc "Don't worry, when I walk you to the car I'll take it. What is it?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2525
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5a3a37fe:

    # aar "Es uno de los últimos productos de NTR. Un test de embarazo rápido. Todavía no está aprobado por la FDA, pero las chicas me pidieron que trajera una caja."
    aar "This is one of NTR's latest products. A rapid pregnancy test. It's not FDA approved yet, but the girls asked me to bring a box."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2526
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_3d20d171:

    # mc "¿Rápido? ¿15 segundos? Los normales tardan cinco minutos..."
    mc "Fast? 15 seconds? The normal ones take five minutes..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2527
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_52fde766:

    # aar "No me refiero a eso. Es un test que se puede hacer 48 horas después de tener relaciones. Solo necesita una gota de sangre y en 24 horas el resultado es 99.9%% preciso."
    aar "That's not what I mean. It's a test that can be done 48 hours after intercourse. You only need one drop of blood and within 24 hours the result is 99.9\% accurate."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2538
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_cdcbc3f6:

    # aar "Las chicas me dijeron que tú sabrías qué hacer con los tests... hay 50. Espero que sean suficientes."
    aar "The girls told me you would know what to do with the tests... there are 50. I hope they are enough."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2540
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_84885411:

    # aar "Bueno, creo que con esto acaba esta reunión. Nos veremos en unas semanas, espero, si no tengo que volver antes."
    aar "Well, I think that wraps up this meeting. I'll see you in a few weeks, I hope, if I don't have to come back sooner."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2541
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8de2db0e:

    # mc "Encantado de haberte conocido, Aaron."
    mc "Nice to have met you, Aaron."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2543
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_83e99fc2:

    # nor "Me ha gustado mucho conocerte, Eva. ¿Por qué no vienes a comer mañana después de las lecciones con [mc]?"
    nor "I really enjoyed meeting you, Eva, why don't you come for lunch tomorrow after the shooting lessons with [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2544
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_45252bbd:

    # nor "Mientras estáis fuera, les contaremos la verdad a las chicas y al resto de la familia."
    nor "While you're away, we'll tell the truth to the girls and the rest of the family."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2545
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d12b9728:

    # eva "Si no hay más remedio... es una de las condiciones que habéis puesto."
    eva "If there is no other choice... it is one of the conditions you have set."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2547
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_2f3e7864:

    # nor "Sólo si quieres. No quiero que te sientas obligada."
    nor "Only if you want to. I don't want you to feel obligated."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2548
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_3ed3cf5c:

    # eva "No, no... lo habéis pedido y vendré, no es justo que os echéis atrás ahora. Cuenta conmigo para comer. Por la tarde retiraré las cámaras de las habitaciones."
    eva "No, no... you asked for it and I'll come. It's not fair that you should back out now. Count me in for lunch. In the afternoon I'll remove the cameras from the rooms."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2550
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_a23e326b:

    # mom "Eso te deja a ti para cenar, Amanda. ¿Te apetece?"
    mom "That leaves you for dinner, Amanda. Would you like to join us?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2551
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_26baa1a8:

    # ama "Me muero de ganas."
    ama "I can't wait."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2553
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_6eaf2b59:

    # mom "[emm] te va a caer muy bien, estoy segura."
    mom "You're going to like [emm] a lot, I'm sure."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2554
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_06a2c2b7:

    # ama "Lo sé. Tengo experiencia tratando con... alguien parecido. *Risita*"
    ama "I know. I have some experience dealing with... someone similar. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2556
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_1d21ebb8:

    # aar "*Susurrando* Me gustaría tener una conversación privada contigo en unos días. ¿Puedo llamarte?"
    aar "*Whispering* I'd like to have a private conversation with you in a few days. Can I give you a call?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2557
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_b8472ded:

    # mc "Por supuesto. ¿Sobre qué?"
    mc "Of course. About what?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2558
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_38c631f6:

    # aar "*Susurrando* Entre otras cosas, sobre dónde me has visto con anterioridad. Recuerda que éramos tres. Pero ahora no es el momento."
    aar "*Whispering* Among other things, about where you have seen me before. Remember, there were three of us. But now is not the time."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2560
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_9e633314:

    # mom "Eva, estoy deseando que vengas a comer mañana y tener más tiempo para conocernos, si las chicas te dejan un minuto."
    mom "Eva, I can't wait for you to come for lunch tomorrow and have more time to get to know each other, if the girls let you have a minute."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2561
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_88319b2f:

    # eva "Seguro que sí... no suelo ser muy sociable... y se van a aburrir de mí enseguida."
    eva "I'm sure they will... I'm not very sociable... and they'll get bored of me right away."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2562
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_77253fee:

    # mom "*Risa* Lo dudo, pero ya lo veremos mañana."
    mom "*Laugh* I doubt it, but we'll see tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2564
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_4a071ec3:

    # nor "Gracias por lo del otro día, Amanda. Tengo muchas ganas de conocerte mejor."
    nor "Thanks for saving us the other day, Amanda. I'm really looking forward to getting to know you better."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2565
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_1109e5d4:

    # ama "Yo también... a todas. Observándoos a distancia parecéis una familia... muy interesante."
    ama "Me too... all of you. Watching you from a distance you look like a... very interesting family."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2566
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ed609ed6:

    # nor "No sé lo que habrás visto... quizás sí que somos un poco diferentes de lo normal..."
    nor "I don't know what you've seen... maybe we are a little different from the norm..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2567
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5a0794bd:

    # mc "¡Ejem! Creo que es momento de acabar con los abrazos. El vuelo de Aaron no va a esperar."
    mc "Ahem! I think it's time to end the hugs. Aaron's flight isn't going to wait."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2569
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_7b7499f5:

    # mc "¡Vale, vale! No hace falta que me miréis como si yo fuera el enemigo. Os vais a ver mañana..."
    mc "Okay, okay! No need to look at me like I'm the enemy. You're going to see each other tomorrow..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2570
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_07e65a90:

    # mc "Os acompaño al coche."
    mc "I'll walk you to the car."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2572
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ca487079:

    # "Después de despedirte de Aaron..."
    "After saying goodbye to Aaron..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2573
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_44e10fe8:

    # mc "Bueno, chicas, nos veremos mañana. Eva, a mediodía en el lago, ¿OK?"
    mc "Well, girls, we'll see you tomorrow. Eva, noon at the lake, OK?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2575
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_388fd1ad:

    # eva "Sí, a mediodía... y gracias..."
    eva "Yes, at noon... and thank you..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2576
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8ee6cc36:

    # mc "No sé por qué, pero no hay de qué..."
    mc "I don't know why, but you're welcome..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2577
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e514a195:

    # eva "Por convencer a [mar] y [nor] de que nos aceptaran... ha sido intenso..."
    eva "For convincing [mar] and [nor] to accept us... it was intense..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2578
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_a9428d84:

    # mc "Yo no..."
    mc "I didn't..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2580
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_817cd02b:

    # ama "No lo niegues, [mc]... ha quedado muy claro que lo de pedir que nos quedáramos lo teníais pactado."
    ama "Don't deny it, [mc]... it's been crystal clear that you had an agreement to ask us to stay. And they didn't know us, so it had to be your idea."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2581
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d85f17d1:

    # mc "Ha sido cosa de ellas, te aseguro que no he tenido nada que ver. No quiero un mérito que no es mío. Aunque yo también lo iba a pedir."
    mc "It was their doing; I assure you I had nothing to do with it. I don't want any credit that's not mine. Although I was going to ask for it too."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2582
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_4917fad3:

    # mc "Pero me alegra que os hayáis sentido así."
    mc "But I'm glad you felt that way."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2583
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_bcb467c7:

    # ama "A ver si Eva me deja despedirme."
    ama "Let's see if Eva will allow me to say goodbye."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2585
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_085ba100:

    # eva "Solo un minuto más..."
    eva "Just another minute..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2586
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_41f840aa:

    # aar "Chicas, el plan de vuelo..."
    aar "Girls, the flight plan..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2587
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_f2f2e83b:

    # eva "Vaaale..."
    eva "Okaaay..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2589
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_62f8c090:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]. Ha sido casi como sentirse parte de la familia por un momento."
    ama "Thank you, [mc]. It felt like we were part of the family for a minute there."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2590
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_790380f1:

    # ama "Me costaba creerte ayer, cuando hablabas de la familia... pero después de esto... tengo muchas ganas de cenar mañana."
    ama "I had a hard time believing you yesterday, when you were talking about the family... but after this... I'm really eager to have dinner tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2591
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_960b0d54:

    # mc "Me temo que se te pasarán en cuanto llegues. Ser el centro de atención puede ser complicado en esta familia. Ármate de paciencia."
    mc "I'm afraid your eagerness will wear off as soon as you arrive. Being the center of attention can be tricky in this family. Steel yourself with patience."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2594
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_c062ae71:

    # "Tras la segunda queja de Aaron sobre el plan de vuelo, te entregan la caja y se marchan a regañadientes."
    "After Aaron's second complaint about the flight plan, they hand you the box and reluctantly leave."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2596
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_27422f28:

    # "Tras la segunda queja de Aaron sobre el plan de vuelo, se marchan a regañadientes."
    "After Aaron's second complaint about the flight plan, they reluctantly leave."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2598
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_250687f0:

    # mc "Ya se han ido. ¿Qué os ha parecido la reunión?"
    mc "They're gone. What did you think about the meeting?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2599
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_120bb197:

    # mom "Extraño... tener a una [emm] que no es nuestra [emm] delante, ha sido extraño... Si no fuera por el pelo..."
    mom "Strange... having an almost-[emm] that's not our [emm] in front of us, it's been weird.... If it wasn't for the hair..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2600
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_08fd2832:

    # nor "Eva me ha parecido... encantadora de una forma rara... al principio estaba distante, pero después... no sé... creo que al final no quería irse."
    nor "Eva has struck me as... charming in a funny way... at first she was distant, but then... I don't know... I think she didn't want to leave in the end."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2601
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_dc245214:

    # mc "Ninguna de las dos quería irse. Ayer estuve hablando con las dos, en la playa..."
    mc "Neither of them wanted to leave. I was talking to both of them yesterday, on the beach..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2603
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_498f76f2:

    # mom "¿Estaban en la playa?" (multiple=2)
    mom "Were they on the beach?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2604
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_4598e340:

    # nor "¿Por qué no les dijiste que se unieran?" (multiple=2)
    nor "Why didn't you tell them to join us?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2605
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d25fc767:

    # mc "Sólo Eva estaba en la playa, vigilándonos. Amanda estaba en su base."
    mc "Only Eva was on the beach, guarding us. Amanda was at her base."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2606
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5471076d:

    # mc "Y decirles que se unieran podría haber sido complicado sin que nuestras chicas supieran de su existencia. Ni nuestras chicas ni el resto, claro."
    mc "And telling them to join might have been complicated without our girls knowing of their existence. Neither our girls nor the rest, of course."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2608
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e29a0f0c:

    # nor "Tienes razón. Solo nosotros, Betty y tu abuela saben de su existencia. Demasiadas explicaciones."
    nor "You're right. Only we, Betty and your Grandma know of their existence. Too many explanations."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2609
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_eb746bde:

    # nor "Y esas explicaciones habrá que darlas mañana. Realmente me da miedo la reacción de las chicas..."
    nor "And those explanations will have to be given tomorrow. I'm really worried about how the girls' will react..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2610
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_8931b604:

    # mc "Aprovechad mientras Eva me enseña a disparar. Creo que es una cosa que cada una de vosotras tiene que hacer con sus hijas. Y no es que me esté escaqueando."
    mc "Do it while Eva teaches me how to shoot. I think it's one thing each of you has to do with your daughters. And it's not like I'm ducking out."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2612
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ee1d1851:

    # mom "Yo también lo creo. Prefiero explicárselo a [emm] a solas."
    mom "I think you're right. I'd rather explain it to [emm] in private."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2613
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e26bbebf:

    # mom "Pero ¿qué hacemos con el resto? Si Scarlett o las estudiantes... o Kiara y Eileen... ven a Eva con [dap] y [eri], o a Amanda con [emm]..."
    mom "But what do we do with the rest? If Scarlett or the students... or Kiara and Eileen.... see Eva with [dap] and [eri], or Amanda with [emm]..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2614
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5bc1056f:

    # mc "¡Uff! No había pensado en eso. Yo confío en que Eileen y Saira podrán guardar el secreto..."
    mc "Whew! I hadn't thought of that. I trust Scarlett, Eileen, and Saira will be able to keep the secret..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2616
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d73d6923:

    # nor "Yo pondría la mano en el fuego por Kiara... Supongo que es mejor explicarles algo al resto de las estudiantes antes de que lo descubran ellas."
    nor "I would put my money on Kiara... I guess it's better to explain something to the rest of the students before they find out for themselves."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2617
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e487bdc0:

    # nor "Podemos decir que son... unas primas que viven lejos..."
    nor "We can say that they are... cousins who live far away..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2618
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_b0356c07:

    # mc "¿Más mentiras, [nor]? Creo que nadie de los que estuvieron ayer en la playa va a hacer nada que pueda perjudicar a las chicas... a ninguna de las cinco."
    mc "More lies, [nor]? I don't think anyone who was on the beach yesterday is going to do anything to harm the girls... none of the five of them."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2620
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5a0ce203:

    # mom "Estoy de acuerdo contigo. Y eso incluye a Samantha, Simone, Alexia... y también a Jamaal. Creo que no nos dejamos a nadie."
    mom "I agree with you. And that includes Samantha, Simone, Alexia... and Jamaal as well. I don't think we forgot anyone."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2622
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_5de91de3:

    # mc "Tan solo a Megan... la invitaste a dormir en casa el fin de semana... va a ver a las chicas juntas."
    mc "Just Megan... you invited her over for a sleepover this weekend... She's going to see the girls together."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2624
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d8aad798:

    # mc "Tan solo a Megan, una amiga... la invité a dormir en casa el fin de semana... va a ver a las chicas juntas."
    mc "Just Megan, a friend... I invited her over for a sleepover this weekend.... She's going to see the girls together."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2625
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_28e839c3:

    # mom "¿Confías en ella?"
    mom "Do you trust her?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2626
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_edb89c5b:

    # mc "Sí. Además, también es amiga de Saira, con lo que es mejor que se lo cuente yo antes de que se entere por otros medios."
    mc "Yes. Besides, she's also a friend of Saira's, so it's better that I tell her before she finds out by other means."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2627
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_4760328a:

    # mc "¡Joder! Tantos años guardando el secreto y ahora lo destapamos a lo grande..."
    mc "Fuck! So many years keeping the secret and now we uncover it in a big way..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2628
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_f360ee27:

    # mc "Un tema aclarado. ¿Qué opináis del tema de la empresa? ¿Qué hacemos?"
    mc "One issue clarified. What do you think about the company question? What should we do?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2630
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e81ed396:

    # nor "Mientras despedías a Eva y a Amanda, hemos decidido que primero hay que explicárselo a nuestras chicas. Ellas también tienen que decidir."
    nor "While you were saying goodbye to Eva and Amanda, we decided that, first, we have to explain it to our girls. They have the right to decide, too."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2631
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_ff0e29d7:

    # nor "La empresa es tan suya como nuestra, o de Aaron, Eva y Amanda, y a lo mejor tienen ideas diferentes sobre qué hacer a las que podamos tener nosotras."
    nor "The company is as much theirs as ours, or Aaron's, Eva's, and Amanda's, and they may have different ideas about what to do than we may have."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2632
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_a37abb9b:

    # mc "Me parece lo más correcto."
    mc "It feels like the right thing to do."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2635
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_4e552617:

    # mom "Cambiando de tema... ¿Qué has hecho con la caja? ¿La de los tests?"
    mom "Changing the subject... What did you do with the box, the one with the tests?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2638
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_551b52c3:

    # nor "Cambiando de tema... ¿Qué has hecho con la caja? ¿La de los tests?"
    nor "Changing the subject... What did you do with the box, the one with the tests?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2640
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d321a2ef:

    # mc "La he dejado en el recibidor."
    mc "I left it in the foyer."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2648
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_7df20501:

    # mcp "(No creo que venga de un minuto. Hay que esperar 24 horas para saber los resultados. *Risa mental*)"
    mcp "(I don't think it will be a minute issue. You have to wait 24 hours to know the results. * Mental Laughter*)"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2651
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_100bf87f:

    # "Hacéis las pruebas de embarazo. Son tan sencillas como poner una gota de sangre en una tira de plástico y ponerla dentro de una pequeña máquina."
    "You perform the pregnancy tests. They're as simple as putting a drop of blood on a plastic strip and putting it inside a little machine."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2652
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_d5786b61:

    # "Etiquetáis las pruebas con el nombre de [nor] y [mar] y las guardáis en lugar seguro, en la habitación de [nor]."
    "You label the tests with the name of [nor] and [mar] and keep them in a safe place, in [nor]'s room."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2654
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_74934509:

    # "Hacéis la prueba de embarazo. Es tan sencilla como poner una gota de sangre en una tira de plástico y ponerla dentro de una pequeña máquina. La guardáis en lugar seguro."
    "You perform the pregnancy test. It's as simple as putting a drop of blood on a plastic strip and putting it inside a little machine. You keep it in a safe place."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2655
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_e0220bc1:

    # "Continuáis hablando sobre la reunión un rato, antes de que empiecen a volver las chicas que han ido a la ciudad."
    "You continue talking about the meeting for a while, before the girls who have gone to town start coming back."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2658
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_977d1c5d:

    # "Te llevas la caja con las otras 48 pruebas a tu habitación. Esperas tener suficientes para el resto de tu vida."
    "You take the box with the remaining 48 tests back to your room. You hope you have enough for the rest of your life."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2660
translate english c15s006_AaronVisit_2fd66ddd:

    # "Te llevas la caja con las 50 pruebas de embarazo a tu habitación. Esperas tener suficientes para el resto de tu vida."
    "You take the box with the 50 pregnancy tests to your room. You hope you have enough for the rest of your life."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2665
translate english c15s006_Story_2e4e4045:

    # aar "OK. Ya sabéis quién fundó NTR. Tenéis que entender que eran unos genios."
    aar "OK. You know who founded NTR. You have to understand that they were geniuses."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2668
translate english c15s006_Story_0986c2d4:

    # aar "OK. Ya sabéis quién fundó NTR. Tienes que saber que tu madre era un genio, [mc]. Todos lo eran."
    aar "OK. You know who founded NTR. You have to know that your mother was a genius, [mc]. They all were."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2669
translate english c15s006_Story_88dfca2e:

    # aar "Empezaron estudiando árboles genealógicos basándose en el ADN. Pero hicieron un descubrimiento rompedor."
    aar "They started by studying family trees based on DNA. But they made a groundbreaking discovery."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2670
translate english c15s006_Story_fe83aec9:

    # aar "Ya se habían hecho clonaciones anteriormente de animales. Todos recordamos a Dolly."
    aar "Animal cloning has been done before. We all remember Dolly."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2671
translate english c15s006_Story_bec1f593:

    # aar "Pero ellos descubrieron como hacer clonaciones aceleradas. De embrión a individuo viable en un tercio del tiempo de gestación."
    aar "But they figured out how to do accelerated cloning. From embryo to viable individual in a third of the gestation time."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2673
translate english c15s006_Story_7c1c7aca:

    # aar "Daniel era la gran mente detrás de ello."
    aar "Daniel was the great mind behind it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2675
translate english c15s006_Story_c2848b1c:

    # aar "Anna era la gran mente detrás de ello."
    aar "Anna was the great mind behind it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2677
translate english c15s006_Story_39cd7c12:

    # aar "Empezaron clonando animales... ovejas, cerdos..."
    aar "They started by cloning animals... sheep, pigs..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2678
translate english c15s006_Story_17d1281c:

    # aar "Pero Dominic convenció al resto para que probasen la clonación humana. Ahí es donde estaría el dinero de verdad. Imaginaros tener un clon humano en solo tres meses."
    aar "But Dominic convinced the rest to try human cloning. That's where the real money would be. Imagine having a human clone in only three months."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2679
translate english c15s006_Story_4a1d0b10:

    # aar "Obviamente en los Estados Unidos era ilegal, con lo que compraron laboratorios en un par de países donde la legislación era poco clara al respecto."
    aar "Obviously, it was illegal in the States, so they bought labs in a couple of countries where the legislation was unclear about it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2680
translate english c15s006_Story_53280390:

    # aar "Después de varios experimentos en el extranjero consiguen la primera clonación más o menos correcta. La Serie A. Yo y mis dos hermanos. Alfred y Arnau."
    aar "After several experiments abroad, they achieved the first more or less correct cloning. Series A. Me and my two brothers. Alfred and Arnau."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2682
translate english c15s006_Story_0a2a7e26:

    # mc "Espera... has dicho que eso pasó hace 20 o 21 años. ¿Cómo puedes ser tú?"
    mc "Wait... you said that happened 20 or 21 years ago. How can you be a Series A?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2683
translate english c15s006_Story_ba72dc5e:

    # aar "Porque yo tengo 21 años. No solo se triplicaba la velocidad de gestación. El envejecimiento no se paraba al \"nacer\"."
    aar "Because I am 21 years old. Not only was the rate of gestation tripled. Aging didn't stop at \"birth\"."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2684
translate english c15s006_Story_5dce615d:

    # aar "Además, el material genético inicial... Bueno, eso es para otro día... hoy no hay tiempo."
    aar "Also, the initial genetic material.... Well, that's for another day... no time today."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2685
translate english c15s006_Story_e218d169:

    # mc "¡Joder! Entonces..."
    mc "Fuck! Then..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2687
translate english c15s006_Story_f1ce2633:

    # aar "Sí, mi cuerpo tiene más de 60. Pero no estamos aquí para hablar de mí."
    aar "Yes, my body is over 60. But we're not here to talk about me."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2688
translate english c15s006_Story_110a83f1:

    # aar "Después llegó la Serie B. Brandon, Bryce, Brady, Benito, y Bart. Los chicos no salieron bien."
    aar "Then came Series B. Brandon, Bryce, Brady, Benito, and Bart. The guys didn't turn out well."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2689
translate english c15s006_Story_784d8983:

    # aar "Intentaron controlar el envejecimiento una vez fuera de los tubos, pero no funcionó. El resultado fue inverso. A los 10 años estaban peor que yo ahora."
    aar "They tried to control aging once out of the tubes, but it didn't work. The result was the reverse. At 10 years old they were older than I am now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2692
translate english c15s006_Story_392aaa06:

    # aar "Para la tercera serie, Daniel decidió probar otra cosa. Clonar chicas introduciendo algunos cambios."
    aar "For the third series, Daniel decided to try something completely different. Clone girls while introducing a few changes."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2693
translate english c15s006_Story_87f5648a:

    # mc "Y aparecen Amanda y Eva, ¿no?"
    mc "And Amanda and Eva appear, don't they?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2694
translate english c15s006_Story_479d6206:

    # aar "Exacto."
    aar "Exactly."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2696
translate english c15s006_Story_2812f62f:

    # eva "También Beatrice, Claire, y Diana... y Fiona..."
    eva "Beatrice, Claire, and Diana... and Fiona too"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2698
translate english c15s006_Story_a75c0ec1:

    # nor "Pero ¿De dónde sacaron el material?"
    nor "But where did they get the genetic material?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2699
translate english c15s006_Story_4d81478d:

    # mom "Nunca perdí a [emm] de vista. Nunca se quedó sola cuando íbamos al médico."
    mom "I never let [emm] out of my sight. She was never left alone when we went to the doctor."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2701
translate english c15s006_Story_28e6945d:

    # aar "Estabais embarazadas a la vez. A Daniel se le ocurrió la idea de extraer células de los fetos."
    aar "You were pregnant at the same time. Daniel came up with the idea of extracting cells from the fetuses."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2702
translate english c15s006_Story_c7952ef3:

    # aar "En algún momento os debieron llevar engañadas a las instalaciones de NTR a haceros algunas pruebas y aprovecharon para extraer el material genético."
    aar "At some point you must have been tricked into going to the NTR facility for some tests and they took the opportunity to extract the genetic material."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2704
translate english c15s006_Story_b349305b:

    # mom "¿Sin nuestro consentimiento? ¿Cómo pudieron hacernos eso?"
    mom "Without our consent? How could they do that to us?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2706
translate english c15s006_Story_11a6de7c:

    # nor "¡Qué hijos de puta! ¿Cómo pudo Mike aceptar hacer eso con sus propias hijas?"
    nor "What a bunch of bastards! How could Mike agree to do that with his own daughters?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2708
translate english c15s006_Story_98b6c55b:

    # mom "No te lo tomes mal, cielo... esto es nuevo para nosotras... me alegra que estéis aquí ahora."
    mom "Don't take this the wrong way, sweetie... this is new for us... I'm glad you're here now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2709
translate english c15s006_Story_ccc0dba7:

    # ama "Gracias, [mar]..."
    ama "Thanks, [mar]..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2711
translate english c15s006_Story_3e69544b:

    # nor "Sí, vosotras no tenéis la culpa... pero si Mike no estuviera muerto... lo volvería a matar yo ahora mismo."
    nor "Yes, it's not your fault... but if Mike wasn't dead... I'd kill him again right now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2712
translate english c15s006_Story_35c1ea13:

    # eva "Me gusta como piensas. Yo seguramente haría lo mismo."
    eva "I like the way you think. I would surely do the same."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2714
translate english c15s006_Story_591209eb:

    # aar "El experimento XX fue todo un éxito como podéis ver. Solucionaron el problema de los telómeros cortos y..."
    aar "The XX experiment was a success as you can see. They solved the problem of short telomeres and..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2715
translate english c15s006_Story_6e399718:

    # mc "¿Telo-qué?"
    mc "Telo-what?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2716
translate english c15s006_Story_4485fc64:

    # aar "Telómeros. Es lo que produce el envejecimiento acelerado. Como podéis ver, Eva y Amanda no parecen mayores que [emm], [eri], o [dap]."
    aar "Telomeres. That's what causes accelerated aging. As you can see, Eva and Amanda don't look any older than [emm], [eri], or [dap]."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2717
translate english c15s006_Story_85db7d6a:

    # mc "Ah, OK."
    mc "Ah, Okay."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2718
translate english c15s006_Story_cbc25f4f:

    # mcp "(Necesitaríamos que [dap] estuviera aquí para que nos tradujese la jerga científica.)"
    mcp "(We need [dap] here to translate the scientific jargon for us.)"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2719
translate english c15s006_Story_ce50c030:

    # mc "Pero habéis nombrado a seis chicas, y solo había dos embarazos... o tres si contáis que [nor] tenía gemelas... ¿Quiénes eran las otras...? ¿Donantes?"
    mc "But you named six girls, and there were only two pregnancies... or three if you count that [nor] had twins... Who were the other... donors?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2721
translate english c15s006_Story_9c193365:

    # ama "No había más donantes. Los sujetos A, B, y C, Beatrice, Claire y yo, nacimos de material genético de [emm]. D, E, y F, Diana, Eva, y Fiona, del de [dap] o [eri]."
    ama "There were no other donors. Subjects A, B, and C, Beatrice, Claire, and I, were born from genetic material from [emm]. D, E, and F, Diana, Eva, and Fiona, from that of [dap] or [eri]."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2722
translate english c15s006_Story_301d0456:

    # mc "Ah, vale... tres clones por cada chica."
    mc "Ah, okay... three clones for each girl."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2724
translate english c15s006_Story_56c4dc33:

    # eva "Sí. La idea era que sirviéramos como \"material de repuesto\" por si alguna vez necesitaban un trasplante."
    eva "Yes. The idea was that we would serve as \"spare material\" in case they ever needed a transplant."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2725
translate english c15s006_Story_f0baba46:

    # mc "¡Pero eso es inhumano! ¡Sois personas! No podían pensar en sacrificaros si [dap] hubiera necesitado... yo que sé... un pulmón..."
    mc "But that's inhuman! You're real people! They couldn't think of sacrificing you if [dap] had needed... I don't know... a lung..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2726
translate english c15s006_Story_d41e55ac:

    # eva "Sí, lo es. Y sí, lo pensaban hacer. A ellos les daba lo mismo en ese momento. Solo éramos experimentos."
    eva "Yes, it is. And yes, they were planning to do it. They didn't care for us at the time. We were just experiments."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2728
translate english c15s006_Story_93eae1e7:

    # aar "Y ahí es cuando empezó a torcerse la cosa. Si puedes crear clones y usarlos como repositorio de órganos de cara al futuro..."
    aar "And that's when it started to go wrong. If you can create clones and use them as an organ repository for the future..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2729
translate english c15s006_Story_7e521a9a:

    # mc "Los billonarios se volverían locos por tener eso para sus hijos."
    mc "Billionaires would go crazy to have that for their kids."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2730
translate english c15s006_Story_c4f8d22a:

    # aar "Exacto. Mis chicas nacieron antes que las vuestras. Y se comprobó que el envejecimiento no continuaba una vez fuera del tanque."
    aar "Exactly. My girls were born before yours. And it was proven that aging did not continue once out of the tank."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2732
translate english c15s006_Story_a6f80731:

    # aar "Para la tercera serie, Anna decidió probar otra cosa. Clonar chicas introduciendo algunos cambios."
    aar "For the third series, Anna decided to try something completely different. Clone girls while introducing some changes."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2733
translate english c15s006_Story_20f8a1d8:

    # mc "Y aparecen [emm], [eri] y [dap], ¿no?"
    mc "And [emm], [eri] and [dap] appear, don't they?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2734
translate english c15s006_Story_479d6206_1:

    # aar "Exacto."
    aar "Exactly."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2736
translate english c15s006_Story_63f39f20:

    # nor "Pero ¿De dónde sacaron el material genético?"
    nor "But where did they get the genetic material?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2737
translate english c15s006_Story_12addd33:

    # mom "Mike y Dominic nunca nos lo contaron."
    mom "Mike and Dominic never told us."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2739
translate english c15s006_Story_a377904d:

    # aar "Se pagó a mujeres embarazadas que querían dar sus bebés en adopción. NTR los adoptaría a cambio de hacer unas pruebas con los fetos."
    aar "Pregnant women who wanted to give their babies up for adoption were paid. NTR would adopt them in exchange for doing some tests on the fetuses."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2740
translate english c15s006_Story_09c7b928:

    # aar "En total había seis chicas."
    aar "In total there were six girls."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2741
translate english c15s006_Story_0cf76729:

    # mc "Amanda, Eva, y ¿quién más?"
    mc "Amanda, Eva, and who else?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2743
translate english c15s006_Story_5559fa61:

    # eva "También Beatrice, Claire, y Diana... y Fiona... Ninguna de ellas está entre nosotras a día de hoy."
    eva "Also Beatrice, Claire, and Diana... and Fiona... None of them are among us any longer."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2744
translate english c15s006_Story_7a2f7317:

    # mc "Lo siento..."
    mc "I'm sorry"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2746
translate english c15s006_Story_591209eb_1:

    # aar "El experimento XX fue todo un éxito como podéis ver. Solucionaron el problema de los telómeros cortos y..."
    aar "The XX experiment was a success as you can see. They solved the problem of short telomeres and..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2747
translate english c15s006_Story_6e399718_1:

    # mc "¿Telo-qué?"
    mc "Telo-what?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2748
translate english c15s006_Story_d246e0ec:

    # aar "Telómeros. Es lo que produce el envejecimiento acelerado. Como podéis ver, [emm], [eri], o [dap] no parecen mayores que Eva y Amanda."
    aar "Telomeres. That's what causes accelerated aging. As you can see, [emm], [eri], or [dap] don't look any older than Eva and Amanda."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2749
translate english c15s006_Story_85db7d6a_1:

    # mc "Ah, OK."
    mc "Ah, Okay."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2750
translate english c15s006_Story_cbc25f4f_1:

    # mcp "(Necesitaríamos que [dap] estuviera aquí para que nos tradujese la jerga científica.)"
    mcp "(We need [dap] here to translate the scientific jargon for us.)"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2751
translate english c15s006_Story_9cd3f61e:

    # mc "Pero habéis nombrado a seis chicas, y solo acaba por haber tres clones... o dos si contamos a [eri] y [dap] como uno."
    mc "But you've named six girls, and there only ended up being three clones... or two if we count [eri] and [dap] as one."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2753
translate english c15s006_Story_9834d149:

    # ama "Los clones de Beatrice, Claire, Diana, y Fiona no fueron viables. Dos no llegaron a nacer y otros dos murieron a los pocos días."
    ama "The clones of Beatrice, Claire, Diana, and Fiona were not viable. Two failed to be born and two others died within a few days."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2754
translate english c15s006_Story_9f6b6fd0:

    # mom "Eso es muy triste..."
    mom "That's really sad..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2756
translate english c15s006_Story_3d41feca:

    # nor "¡Qué hijos de puta! ¿Cómo pudo Mike experimentar así con niñas pequeñas?"
    nor "What a bunch of bastards! How could Mike experiment like that with little girls?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2758
translate english c15s006_Story_77996f81:

    # mom "No te lo tomes mal, cielo... esto es nuevo para nosotras... me alegra que estés aquí ahora."
    mom "Don't take this the wrong way, sweetie... this is new for us... I'm glad you're here now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2759
translate english c15s006_Story_ccc0dba7_1:

    # ama "Gracias, [mar]..."
    ama "Thanks, [mar]"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2761
translate english c15s006_Story_3e69544b_1:

    # nor "Sí, vosotras no tenéis la culpa... pero si Mike no estuviera muerto... lo volvería a matar yo ahora mismo."
    nor "Yes, it's not your fault... but if Mike wasn't dead... I'd kill him again right now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2762
translate english c15s006_Story_35c1ea13_1:

    # eva "Me gusta como piensas. Yo seguramente haría lo mismo."
    eva "I like the way you think. I would surely do the same."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2764
translate english c15s006_Story_e6e4453b:

    # aar "Y ahí es cuando empezó a torcerse la cosa. Si puedes crear clones que envejezcan a la vez que sus donantes y usarlos como repositorio de órganos de cara al futuro..."
    aar "And that's when it started to go wrong. If you can create clones that age at the same time as their donors and use them as an organ repository for the future..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2765
translate english c15s006_Story_7e521a9a_1:

    # mc "Los billonarios se volverían locos por tener eso para sus hijos."
    mc "Billionaires would go crazy to have that for their kids."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2766
translate english c15s006_Story_4cbe5d92:

    # aar "Exacto. Cuando vuestras chicas nacieron, se comprobó que el envejecimiento no continuaba una vez fuera del tanque."
    aar "Exactly. When your girls were born, it was found that aging did not continue once out of the tank."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2767
translate english c15s006_Story_11e815f4:

    # aar "Dominic hizo contactos con un tipo muy rico. Había mucho dinero en juego."
    aar "Dominic made contacts with a very rich guy. There was a lot of money involved."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2769
translate english c15s006_Story_b740950d:

    # aar "Y entoces, llegó el accidente de avión. Se sospechó de un sabotaje, pero no se pudo probar nada."
    aar "And then came the plane crash. Sabotage was suspected, but nothing could be proven."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2770
translate english c15s006_Story_19fe89de:

    # aar "Después de la reestructuración de NTR y GILF, se intentó llevar a cabo la primera clonación del hijo de un millonario."
    aar "After the restructuring of NTR and GILF, the first cloning of a millionaire's son was attempted."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2772
translate english c15s006_Story_f1b6d097:

    # aar "No funcionó. Creemos que una parte fundamental del trabajo en parar el envejecimiento estaba en alguno de los portátiles que se destruyeron en el accidente."
    aar "It didn't work. We believe that a key part of the work in stopping the aging was in some of the laptops that were destroyed in the accident."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2773
translate english c15s006_Story_cec9ae65:

    # aar "Faltaban datos en los servidores de NTR. Se redujo el ratio de envejecimiento. Primero a 2.8, 2.5, 2... pero nunca han conseguido que sea inferior a 1.7."
    aar "Data was missing from NTR servers. They reduced the aging ratio. First to 2.8, 2.5, 2... but they never got it below 1.7."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2774
translate english c15s006_Story_fd8b467e:

    # mc "¿Qué pasó con esos clones fallidos?"
    mc "What happened to those failed clones?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2776
translate english c15s006_Story_9f9374c8:

    # aar "Si no puedes utilizarlos como repositorio de órganos para sus donantes millonarios, ¿qué puedes hacer con unos clones que a los 6 años tienen el cuerpo de alguien de 18?"
    aar "If you can't use them as organ repositories for their millionaire donors, what can you do with clones who at 6 years old have the body of an 18 year old?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2777
translate english c15s006_Story_e7141d72:

    # aar "Con la capacidad de aprendizaje de un niño pequeño, pero con la fuerza y la agilidad de un adulto."
    aar "With the learning ability of a small child, but with the strength and agility of an adult."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2778
translate english c15s006_Story_0ca5cad8:

    # mc "Un ejército de clones."
    mc "A clone army."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2780
translate english c15s006_Story_8df4e326:

    # aar "Exacto. Los entrenas para realizar operaciones encubiertas y los alquilas al mejor postor."
    aar "Exactly. You train them to conduct covert operations and rent them out to the highest bidder."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2781
translate english c15s006_Story_63b919cf:

    # mc "No es justo. Seguían... seguíais siendo niños..."
    mc "That's not fair. They... you still were little kids..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2783
translate english c15s006_Story_77c9af73:

    # ama "Si y no. Eric solo tiene 15 años aunque su cuerpo ronde los 30. Pero ya has visto como puede ser..."
    ama "Yes and no. Eric is younger than he appears even though his body is around 30. But you've seen how he can be..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2784
translate english c15s006_Story_9ff9cb54:

    # mc "Lo había leído, pero las edades reales y aparentes no encajaban."
    mc "I had read it, but the real and apparent ages didn't fit."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2786
translate english c15s006_Story_2d96ce22:

    # eva "Y no le hubiera importado mataros si hubiera sido necesario, si no hubierais querido firmar... al menos a uno de vosotros, para forzar a los demás."
    eva "And he wouldn't have minded killing you if necessary, if you hadn't wanted to sign... at least one of you, to force the others to sign."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2787
translate english c15s006_Story_96945c8f:

    # mc "¿Iba en serio lo de matarnos?"
    mc "Was he serious about killing us?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2789
translate english c15s006_Story_7e100c10:

    # aar "Ya llegaremos al tema de los asesinatos más tarde..."
    aar "We'll get to the murder issue later..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2790
translate english c15s006_Story_8aa83788:

    # mc "Pero..."
    mc "But..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2791
translate english c15s006_Story_9cf5b234:

    # aar "Mas tarde, [mc]."
    aar "Later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2793
translate english c15s006_Story_82aff823:

    # aar "En definitiva, en pocos años NTR y GILF tuvieron un pequeño ejército de clones entrenados. Cuando los A teníamos 8 años empezamos a hacer misiones."
    aar "All in all, within a few years NTR and GILF had a small army of trained clones. When we A's were 8 years old we started doing missions."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2794
translate english c15s006_Story_ad275ac8:

    # aar "Después se unieron los C, los D... Había gobiernos, como el vuestro, que pagaban muy bien por un equipo de mercenarios que no se pudiera relacionar con ellos."
    aar "Then the C's joined in, then the D's... There were governments, like yours, that paid very well for a mercenary team that couldn't be linked to them."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2795
translate english c15s006_Story_e24de9ea:

    # aar "Las chicas empezaron con sus misiones hace cuatro años, cuando cumplieron 14. Menos Fiona, que había muerto en un accidente durante el entrenamiento."
    aar "The girls started their missions four years ago, when they turned 14. Except for Fiona, who had died in an accident during training."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2797
translate english c15s006_Story_3a26c691:

    # mom "Lo siento mucho, Amanda... supongo que... debía ser como una hermana para vosotras."
    mom "I'm so sorry, Amanda... I guess she was... she must have been like a sister to you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2798
translate english c15s006_Story_cf031570:

    # ama "No como una hermana... era una hermana de verdad..."
    ama "Not like a sister...she was a real sister..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2800
translate english c15s006_Story_c39c3603:

    # nor "Debió de ser duro para vosotras."
    nor "It must have been hard for you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2801
translate english c15s006_Story_21d2693c:

    # eva "Fue la primera en morir. Es un golpe duro cuando ves morir a tu hermana a los 12 años en una explosión."
    eva "She was the first to die. It's a hard blow when you see your sister die in an explosion at the age of 12."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2802
translate english c15s006_Story_4e64105c:

    # mc "¿12 años? ¡Joder! ¿Cuándo empezasteis a entrenar?"
    mc "12 years? Fuck! When did you start training?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2804
translate english c15s006_Story_3ce96331:

    # aar "Las chicas empezaron a entrenar a los 6 años. Tenían el cuerpo de una niña de 6 años, pero cuando todo lo que haces es entrenar... te conviertes en bueno. Y ellas son muy buenas."
    aar "The girls started training at 6 years old. They had the body of a 6-year-old, but when all you do is train... you become good. And they are very good."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2805
translate english c15s006_Story_e84add3c:

    # mcp "(No puedo evitar imaginarme a [emm] o [dap] con una metralleta con 6 años. Es una imagen ridícula. No puedo imaginar por lo que han pasado Eva y Amanda.)"
    mcp "(I can't help but picture [emm] or [dap] with a machine gun at 6 years old. It's a ridiculous image. I can't imagine what Eva and Amanda have been through.)"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2807
translate english c15s006_Story_04cda04d:

    # aar "Con un suministro cada vez mayor de agentes, NTR creció mucho."
    aar "With an ever-increasing supply of agents, NTR grew a lot."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2808
translate english c15s006_Story_da6d06a8:

    # aar "El director de GILF, Richard, sabía que eso podría funcionar por un tiempo limitado, conocía el testamento de los fundadores y sabía que heredaríais... heredaríamos la empresa."
    aar "The director of GILF, Richard, knew that this could work only for a limited time, he knew the will of the Founders and he knew that you... we would inherit the company."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2809
translate english c15s006_Story_4c8cf79a:

    # mc "Y no podía saber qué haríamos con ella o si estaríamos de acuerdo con la forma de operarla."
    mc "And he couldn't know what we would do with it or whether we would agree on how to operate it."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2811
translate english c15s006_Story_6d1ab377:

    # aar "Exacto. Pero Richard había sido amigo y compañero de los Fundadores desde el principio y estaba dispuesto a cumplir su última voluntad."
    aar "Exactly. But Richard had been a friend and companion of the Founders from the beginning and was willing to fulfill their last will."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2812
translate english c15s006_Story_429f5091:

    # aar "Pero Richard murió hace unos meses. Causas naturales. Su segundo, Xabier, tomó el mando y descubrió el testamento."
    aar "But Richard died a few months ago. Natural causes. His second, Xabier, took over and discovered the will."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2813
translate english c15s006_Story_efe17ca5:

    # mc "Y él no estaba dispuesto a cumplir con las condiciones."
    mc "And he was unwilling to honor the conditions."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2815
translate english c15s006_Story_8e805ceb:

    # aar "Exacto. Si moríais antes de que la última cláusula del testamento entrara en vigor, la propiedad de NTR pasaba definitivamente a GILF."
    aar "Exactly. If you died before the last clause of the will went into effect, the ownership of NTR would definitely pass to GILF."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2816
translate english c15s006_Story_b7be54a4:

    # aar "Se ordenó a la serie XX asesinaros. A todos."
    aar "The XX series was ordered to execute you. All of you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2817
translate english c15s006_Story_55a2b5a8:

    # mc "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¡Nos han estado defendiendo!"
    mc "{b}What?{/b} But they've been protecting us!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2819
translate english c15s006_Story_91acd48b:

    # mom "¿Nos iban a matar por una empresa?" (multiple=2)
    mom "Were they going to kill us for a company?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2820
translate english c15s006_Story_b1c8da99:

    # nor "¿Tan importante es?" (multiple=2)
    nor "Is it that important?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2822
translate english c15s006_Story_e9cea5ee:

    # eva "No seáis inocentes. La mayoría de los asesinatos tienen que ver con dinero o con poder. Y NTR vale MUCHO dinero, y los propietarios de NTR pueden tener MUCHO poder."
    eva "Don't be innocent. Most assassinations have to do with money or power. And NTR is worth a LOT of money, and the owners of NTR may have a LOT of power."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2823
translate english c15s006_Story_ee93f2ac:

    # eva "La orden de asesinato tenía una parte oculta. La que nos llegó a nosotras decía que cuando acabáramos con vosotros teníamos que matar también a los A."
    eva "The execution order had a hidden part. The one that reached us said that when we were done with you, we had to kill the two remaining A's too."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2825
translate english c15s006_Story_9fb6de33:

    # ama "Erais unos civiles, con lo que no se dedicaron muchos recursos. Cinco agentes a la caza de seis civiles. Una misión fácil."
    ama "You were civilians, so not a lot of resources were committed. Five agents on the hunt for six civilians. An easy mission."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2827
translate english c15s006_Story_45cf3476:

    # aar "Cuando las chicas recibieron las órdenes, vinieron a vernos a Arnau y a mí a explicarnos las órdenes que habían recibido respecto a nosotros."
    aar "When the girls received the orders, they came to see Arnau and me to explain the orders they received regarding us."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2828
translate english c15s006_Story_0ef75901:

    # aar "Debía tratarse de un error. Arnau fue a hablar con Xabier para aclararlo y nunca volvió. Nosotros nos fuimos de la base. Pudimos huir por los pelos."
    aar "It must have been a mistake. Arnau went to talk to Xabier to clear it up and never came back. We left the base. We were able to escape by the skin of our teeth."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2829
translate english c15s006_Story_305abcf0:

    # mc "Y fue cuando decidisteis protegernos, ¿no?"
    mc "And that's when you decided to protect us, wasn't it?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2831
translate english c15s006_Story_7a277806:

    # eva "Ya sabes... el enemigo de mi enemigo... Si os querían muertos sería por algo y nosotros aún no sabíamos por qué."
    eva "You know... the enemy of my enemy... If they wanted you dead it would be for some reason, and we still didn't know why."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2833
translate english c15s006_Story_cb647f23:

    # ama "Aaron y Claire investigaron y descubrieron la cláusula del testamento mientras Eva y yo protegíamos a la familia en Newport, y Beatrice y Diana te protegían a ti en Portland."
    ama "Aaron and Claire researched a lot and discovered the clause in the will. Meanwhile, Eva and I were protecting the family in Newport, and Beatrice and Diana were protecting you in Portland."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2834
translate english c15s006_Story_1a127223:

    # ama "Como es normal en estos casos, la información fluía entre nosotros, con lo que, cuando llegaste a Newport, sabíamos mucho de ti."
    ama "As is standard in these cases, information flowed between us, so by the time you arrived in Newport, we knew a lot about you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2836
translate english c15s006_Story_6e917ecd:

    # aar "Decidimos que, si queríamos sobrevivir, erais nuestra mejor opción. Además, lo que hacía Xabier iba en contra de la voluntad de los Fundadores."
    aar "We decided that, if we wanted to survive, you were our best option. Besides, what Xabier was doing was against the will of the Founders."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2837
translate english c15s006_Story_fd9977e5:

    # aar "Pero la mayoría de los agentes, menos los G, son buenos. Nos acabaron encontrando."
    aar "But most of the agents, except the Gs, are good. They ended up finding us."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2838
translate english c15s006_Story_4df10028:

    # aar "Primero murió Claire, después Beatrice y Diana. Ahora solo quedamos nosotros tres."
    aar "Claire died first, then Beatrice and Diana. Now it's just the three of us left."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2839
translate english c15s006_Story_0801f748:

    # mc "¿Y qué va a pasar ahora? ¿Van a seguir intentando asesinarnos?"
    mc "So what's going to happen now, are they going to keep trying to assassinate us?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2841
translate english c15s006_Story_a13e8619:

    # ama "No. Una vez entró en vigor la cláusula, mataros no tiene sentido. Por eso Eric quería que firmarais el traspaso de acciones."
    ama "No. Once the clause went into effect, killing you makes no sense. That's why Eric wanted you to sign the stock transfer."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2842
translate english c15s006_Story_8f638558:

    # ama "Tampoco tiene sentido que nos den caza a nosotros. Ya tenemos el control de NTR y Aaron ha cancelado las órdenes."
    ama "It doesn't make sense for them to hunt us down either. We already have control of NTR and Aaron has cancelled the orders."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2844
translate english c15s006_Story_ee3f23fd:

    # eva "Hemos tenido que falsificar alguna de vuestras firmas... *Risita*"
    eva "We had to forge some of your signatures... *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2846
translate english c15s006_Story_0bbb8565:

    # aar "Xabier ha sido apartado de su puesto y ahora está todo bajo control... más o menos."
    aar "Xabier has been removed from his post and now everything is under control... more or less."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2847
translate english c15s006_Story_9c1a047c:

    # mc "¿Más o menos?"
    mc "More or less?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2848
translate english c15s006_Story_ec76c9ea:

    # aar "Hay todavía algún agente con el que no hemos logrado contactar para anular sus órdenes, pero estará resuelto en los próximos días."
    aar "There are still some agents that we have not been able to contact to cancel their orders, but it will be resolved in the next few days."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2851
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_35660b71:

    # "Por fin llega la hora de ir a casa de Eileen y Kiara a buscar sus cosas. Esperas que Solomon no esté allí."
    "It's finally time to go to Eileen and Kiara's house to get their stuff. You hope Solomon isn't there."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2852
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_d9eadcbf:

    # "Llamas a Alexia y quedáis en la puerta. Está a punto de terminar su turno y os acompañará antes de volver a la comisaría."
    "You call Alexia and arrange to meet her at the door. She is about to finish her shift and will join you before returning to the station."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2855
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_8de98c3a:

    # "Antes de salir le das a Eileen una de las pruebas de embarazo de Aaron, ponéis la gota de sangre y la guarda en su habitación."
    "Before you leave, you give Eileen one of Aaron's pregnancy tests, put in the drop of blood, and she stores it in a closet in her room."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2856
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_742d918d:

    # "Explicarle de dónde ha salido ha sido difícil. Contarle la verdad sobre [eri], [emm] y [dap] ha sido una odisea."
    "Explaining to her where it has come from has been difficult. Telling her the truth about [eri], [emm] and [dap] had been an odyssey."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2858
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_0c5702e1:

    # "Coges otra prueba para Alexia."
    "You take another test for Alexia."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2860
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_55b681dd:

    # "Antes de salir coges una de las pruebas de embarazo de Aaron para dársela a Alexia. Tendrás que explicarle de dónde ha salido."
    "Before you leave you take one of Aaron's pregnancy tests to give to Alexia. You'll have to explain to her where it came from."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2862
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_48823e75:

    # "Aprovechas el viaje para explicarle también a Kiara la situación de [eri], [emm], [dap], Amanda y Eva."
    "You use the trip to also explain to Kiara the situation of [eri], [emm], [dap], Amanda, and Eva."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2864
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_0af164cc:

    # "Aprovechas el viaje para explicarles a Eileen y a Kiara la situación de [eri], [emm], [dap], Amanda y Eva."
    "You use the trip to explain to Eileen and Kiara the situation of [eri], [emm], [dap], Amanda and Eva."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2865
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e9358946:

    # "Lo vas a llamar La Conversación de los Clones. O simplemente \"La Conversación\". La vas a tener mucho en los próximos días."
    "You're going to call it The Conversation of the Clones. Or just \"The Conversation\". You're going to have it a lot in the next few days."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2866
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_193cf1fe:

    # "Flipan. Hablan entre ellas. Prometen guardar el secreto. Caen en un silencio pensativo hasta estar cerca de su casa."
    "They freak out. They talk to each other. They promise to keep the secret. They fall into a thoughtful silence until they are close to home."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2868
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_505890c5:

    # mc "¿Nerviosas?"
    mc "Nervous?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2869
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_299e1217:

    # eil "No deberíamos estarlo. Tan solo volvemos a casa a por unas cosas, pero..."
    eil "We shouldn't be. We're just going home to get a few things, but..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2871
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_af3c5ba5:

    # kia "Pero parece que volvamos como unas ladronas... es una sensación rara..."
    kia "But it feels like we're coming back as thieves... it's a weird feeling..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2872
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e2538f64:

    # kia "He llamado a mi vecina y me ha dicho que Solomon no está en casa, con lo que no debería haber problemas."
    kia "I called my neighbor and she said that Solomon is not at home, so there should be no problem."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2873
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_cdc1add0:

    # mc "Bueno, cojamos las cosas antes de que vuelva y no tendremos ningún problema. Alexia ya debe estar allí."
    mc "Well, let's get your stuff before he comes back and we won't have any trouble. Alexia should already be there."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2875
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e9cda0cf:

    # mc "Gracias por venir, Alexia."
    mc "Thank you for coming, Alexia."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2876
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_3d306583:

    # oma "Es lo menos que podía hacer, ¿no? Para eso estamos las amigas"
    oma "It's the least I could do, right? That's what friends are for."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2877
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_b618bf92:

    # mc "Tengo que hablar contigo un momento."
    mc "I need to talk to you for a moment."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2879
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_df29e7bd:

    # kia "Os dejamos que habléis mientras vamos trayendo cosas. Supongo que vas a tener \"La Conversación\"."
    kia "We'll let you guys talk while we're bringing stuff out. I guess you're going to have \"The Conversation\"."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2880
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_8013bb0b:

    # mc "Sí, es algo que quiero que sepa toda la familia lo antes posible."
    mc "Yes, it's something I want the whole family to know as soon as possible."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2882
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_3f1adecd:

    # oma "¿Que es eso de La Conversación? Casi se podían escuchar las mayúsculas."
    oma "What's this about The Conversation? You could almost hear the capital letters."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2883
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e13243d4:

    # mc "Te acuerdas de que te llamé el lunes mientras llevabas a tu abuelo a San Diego, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You remember I called you on Monday while you were driving your grandfather to San Diego, right?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2885
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_45c4f46b:

    # "Le explicas el secuestro, por qué la llamaste ese día mientras conducía a San Diego, y todo lo que ha pasado desde entonces."
    "You explain the kidnapping, why you called her that day while she was driving to San Diego, and everything that has happened since."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2886
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_1a5d58e4:

    # "También todo lo que va a pasar a partir de ahora y el secreto familiar."
    "Also, everything that's going to happen from now on. And the family secret."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2888
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_0e6979b3:

    # oma "Es alucinante... parece sacado de una novela mala de ciencia ficción y espionaje escrita por un escritor tarado..."
    oma "It's mind-blowing... it's like something out of a bad sci-fi and espionage novel written by a moronic writer..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2889
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_968dde08:

    # mc "Yo he pensado lo mismo cuando nos han dicho que sobre el accidente hubo sospechas de sabotaje."
    mc "I thought the same thing when we were told that there were suspicions of sabotage about the accident."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2891
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_4fb1e461:

    # oma "Gracias por confiar en mí, [mc]... supongo que también tendré que agradecérselo a [mar] y [nor]."
    oma "Thank you for trusting me, [mc]...I guess I'll have to thank [mar] and [nor] as well."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2893
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_cda2c728:

    # mc "¿Cómo querías que no confiara en mi novia? Te confiaría mi vida."
    mc "How could you expect me not to trust my girlfriend? I would trust you with my life."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2895
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_f99c9cfc:

    # mc "¿Cómo querías que no confiara en ti? Te confiaría mi vida."
    mc "How could you expect me not to trust you? I would trust you with my life."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2896
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_5a1ff281:

    # oma "Pero... no sé... después de lo de ayer... ahora esto... ¿me podéis adoptar?"
    oma "But... I don't know... after yesterday... now this... can you adopt me?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2897
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_9ae2b2cf:

    # mc "Yo creía que ya lo habíamos hecho. *Risa*"
    mc "I thought we had already done that. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2900
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_2e616ea7:

    # oma "Genial, pero... ¿cuánto vas a tardar en darme el test? Me muero de ganas por saberlo."
    oma "Great, but... how long are you going to take to give me the test? I can't wait to find out."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2901
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_a5ae2e37:

    # mc "Alexia, el test tarda 24 horas en dar el resultado. ¿No querrías hacerlo en casa, más tranquila?"
    mc "Alexia, the test takes 24 hours to give the result. Wouldn't you want to do it at home, while you are relaxed?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2903
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_80c99b29:

    # oma "Soy la primera latina en tu vida, ¿verdad?"
    oma "I'm the first Latina in your life, right?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2904
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_22367688:

    # oma "¡Lo quiero ahora! *Risa* No me hagas cometer un delito y robártelo."
    oma "I want it now! *Laugh* Don't make me commit a crime and steal it from you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2905
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_caf77453:

    # mc "Vale, vale. Ahora te lo doy."
    mc "Okay, okay. I'll give it to you now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2907
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_438aa405:

    # "Coges el test de la guantera y lo abres. Buscas un sitio donde hacerlo y no encuentras ninguno mejor que el asiento del copiloto."
    "You take the test from the glove box and open it. You look for a place to do it and you can't find a better place than the passenger seat."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2908
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_5ddf1c56:

    # "Sacáis una gota de sangre del dedo de Alexia, la ponéis en la tira de plástico, y la introducís en la máquina. Se enciende una luz roja."
    "You take a drop of blood from Alexia's finger, put it on the plastic strip, and insert it into the machine. A red light turns on."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2910
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_f0fdd940:

    # oma "¿Qué es esa luz roja? ¿Significa que no estoy embarazada? ¿O que lo estoy?"
    oma "What's that red light? Does it mean I'm not pregnant? Or that I am?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2911
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_912d48a3:

    # mc "Significa que ha reconocido la tira de plástico y que hay sangre dentro. Se pondrá verde cuando tenga el resultado mañana a esta hora."
    mc "It means it recognized the plastic strip and that there is blood inside. It will turn green when it gets the result by this time tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2912
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e3b61f66:

    # mc "La otra luz se pondrá verde si el resultado es positivo y roja si es negativo."
    mc "The other light will turn green if the result is positive and red if it is negative."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2914
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_68ac5c07:

    # oma "¿Y si se queda sin batería?"
    oma "What if it runs out of battery?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2915
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_d6fd4739:

    # mc "Alexia, es una empresa de tecnología punta que hace clones. Creo que habrán pensado en ponerle la batería suficiente para que pueda funcionar durante 24 horas."
    mc "Alexia, it's a high-tech company that clones people. I think they will have thought of putting a battery big enough in it so that it can run for 24 hours."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2916
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ceb1c2d3:

    # oma "Tienes razón... es que estoy muy nerviosa... es la primera vez que quiero estar embarazada en mi vida..."
    oma "You're right... I'm just very nervous... it's the first time I want to be pregnant in my life..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2917
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_bf1793d4:

    # mc "Mañana sabremos si lo estás. ¿Te lo quieres llevar?"
    mc "We'll know tomorrow if you are. Do you want to take it?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2919
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_3009562d:

    # oma "No, mejor llévatelo tú. Imagínate que me lo dejo en el coche patrulla y lo coge otro compañero sin saber qué es."
    oma "No, you'd better take it. Imagine I leave it in the patrol car and another colleague takes it without knowing what it is."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2920
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_f2e15f15:

    # mc "Vale, lo meteré en la guantera y al llegar a casa..."
    mc "Okay, I'll put it in the glove compartment and when I get home..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2922
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_f3c00517:

    # eil "Aquí está la bici. Mi madre está llenando sus maletas. Ahora voy a llenar yo las mías."
    eil "Here's the bike. My mother is filling her suitcases. Now I'm going to fill mine."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2923
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_657d8c2b:

    # mc "¿Necesitáis ayuda?"
    mc "Do you need help?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2925
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_6cefec08:

    # eil "Gracias, pero no. No te quiero ver revolviendo entre mi ropa. *Risa*"
    eil "Thank you, but no. I don't want to see you rummaging through my clothes. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2926
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_891de431:

    # mc "Yo tenía pensado robarte el uniforme de animadora. *Risa*"
    mc "I was planning to steal your cheerleading uniform. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2927
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_784e493f:

    # eil "Voy a empezar a recoger la ropa. Os dejo con La Conversación."
    eil "I'm going to start picking up the laundry. I'll leave you with The Conversation."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2929
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_cc7205ff:

    # oma "Ya la hemos tenido. Es totalmente increíble."
    oma "We've already had it. It's totally unbelievable."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2931
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_058208ae:

    # oma "Y ya hemos hecho el test también."
    oma "And we've already done the test as well."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2932
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e0828f32:

    # mc "Ahora solo falta esperar las 24 horas para saber el resultado."
    mc "Now we just have to wait 24 hours to know the result."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2935
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_c381f290:

    # eil "El tuyo y el mío darán el resultado con una hora de diferencia..."
    eil "Your test and mine will give the result within an hour of each other..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2936
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_081330e5:

    # eil "¿Quieres que los miremos juntas? Yo estaré en el trabajo cuando pasen las 24 horas del mío."
    eil "Do you want to look at them together? I'll be at work when it's 24 hours past mine."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2938
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e60f6be0:

    # oma "Te paso a buscar mañana por el trabajo y vamos a casa de [mc]. Así los podremos mirar juntas, no te preocupes."
    oma "I'll pick you up from work tomorrow and we'll go to [mc]'s house. Then we can look at them together, don't worry."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2939
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_3f262791:

    # oma "Ahora hay que convencer a éste de que no los mire sin nosotras allí."
    oma "Now we have to convince this guy not to look at them without us there."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2940
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_9de3276e:

    # mc "¡Hey! ¡Estoy aquí! Tranquilas, no lo voy a mirar sin vosotras delante."
    mc "Hey! I'm right here! Relax, I'm not going to look at it without you guys."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2941
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_89338246:

    # mc "Eileen, hay unas maletas esperándote. ¿Podemos hablar luego del tema? No me gustaría que tu padre llegara y nos pillara aquí."
    mc "Eileen, there are some suitcases waiting for you. Can we talk about it later? I'd hate for your father to come along and catch us here."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2943
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ba97cdcc:

    # eil "Tranquilo, no volverá hasta medianoche, pero tienes razón, voy a llenar las maletas. Hasta ahora."
    eil "Relax, he won't be back until midnight, but you're right, I'm going to fill the suitcases. See you in 10 minutes."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2944
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_4996e67f:

    # mc "Te esperamos aquí."
    mc "We'll be waiting for you here."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2946
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_600034e3:

    # mc "La situación de Eileen y Kiara es muy jodida."
    mc "Eileen and Kiara's situation is really fucked up."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2947
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_20bbc1e1:

    # oma "Sí que lo es. Si Kiara no quiere denunciar, no podemos hacer nada si no lo pillamos in fraganti."
    oma "Yes it is. If Kiara doesn't want to file a report, we can't do anything if we don't catch him in the act."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2948
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_43c63566:

    # mc "¿Ni siquiera con el testimonio de Eileen?"
    mc "Not even with Eileen's testimony?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2950
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ab10cb2a:

    # oma "Es complicado. Cuando se produjo la agresión, Eileen no estaba. Cuando llegó no hubo más violencia, y la violencia de hace años no nos sirve de nada ahora."
    oma "It's complicated. When the assault happened, Eileen wasn't there. When she arrived there was no more violence, and the violence from years ago is of no use to us now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2951
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_3c0d9d26:

    # mc "Por suerte ahora están a salvo en casa de [nor]."
    mc "Luckily they are safe now at [nor]'s house."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2952
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_b5ce8526:

    # oma "Sí, pero ¿qué pasará cuando vuelvan aquí la semana que viene?"
    oma "Yes, but what will happen when they come back here next week?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2953
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ae2d41ee:

    # mc "Si Solomon es inteligente, las tratará como reinas porque debe estar acojonado ahora mismo."
    mc "If Solomon is smart, he'll treat them like queens because he must be scared shitless right now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2955
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_2d3b1c23:

    # oma "¡Venga ya! Si fuera inteligente no habría hecho lo que ha hecho. Además, ese tipo de personas difícilmente cambian."
    oma "Come on! If he were smart, he wouldn't have done what he did. Besides, that kind of person hardly ever changes."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2956
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_81876fb1:

    # mc "Es lo que le dije a Kiara..."
    mc "That's what I told Kiara..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2957
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_164c2a16:

    # oma "El mayor problema es que no tienen donde ir... o no quieren tener donde ir. Yo les he ofrecido mi casa..."
    oma "The biggest problem is that they have nowhere to go... or they don't want to have anywhere to go. I have offered them my house..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2958
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e90670f1:

    # mc "Y en mi casa se pueden quedar tanto tiempo como quieran, pero Kiara tiene prisa en volver a la suya."
    mc "And they can stay at [nor]'s house as long as they want, but Kiara is in a hurry to get back to hers."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2960
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_a93e5aab:

    # oma "¿No la tendrías tú? En tu casa son invitadas, pero su casa es esta. No es un hogar, pero es su casa."
    oma "Wouldn't you do the same in their place? At your home they are guests, but their house is this one. It's not a home, but it's their house."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2961
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ad6ac7ea:

    # mc "Lo entiendo, pero ¿y si la próxima vez Solomon no se contenta con hacerle unos hematomas?"
    mc "I can understand it, but what if the next time Solomon isn't satisfied with just giving her a few bruises?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2962
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_68527cba:

    # oma "Entonces tendrá que denunciar, o irse, o..."
    oma "Then she will have to denounce, or leave, or..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2964
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_0d05effb:

    # "Radio" "Martínez, ¿estás operativa todavía? Todavía veo la chatarra de tu coche en el aparcamiento."
    "Radio" "Martinez, are you still operational? I still see the junk from your car in the parking lot."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2966
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_55f41ab6:

    # oma "Sí, Schrute. He acabado mi turno, pero estoy haciendo un último servicio. Dime."
    oma "Yes, Schrute. I've finished my shift, but I'm doing one last service. Talk to me."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2970
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_4975e053:

    # sch "Ha habido un accidente en Mill Road. ¿Te puedes acercar?"
    sch "There's been an accident on Mill Road, can you go there?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2971
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_00e4560a:

    # oma "¿No pueden ir Jones o Garcia? Hace una hora que han empezado su turno."
    oma "Can't Jones or Garcia go? They started their shift an hour ago."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2972
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_4cb0461b:

    # sch "Ahí está el problema. El accidente lo ha tenido Jones contra un civil. Él está bien, pero su coche no. El civil necesitará atención. Ya he enviado la grúa y la ambulancia."
    sch "There's the rub. The accident was Jones versus a civilian. He's fine, but his car is not. The civilian needs attention. I've already sent the tow truck and ambulance."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2973
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_2633fd2e:

    # sch "Y antes de que preguntes, Garcia está en un servicio, esta vez no se está escaqueando."
    sch "And before you ask, Garcia is on a service, this time he's not ducking out."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2974
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_aba38a4c:

    # oma "Lo entiendo. Voy para allá."
    oma "I understand. I'm on my way."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2975
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_2c87ba1a:

    # sch "Gracias, preciosa. Trae a Jones aquí. Le tendrás que dejar tu coche patrulla para esta noche."
    sch "Thank you, precious. Get Jones in here. You'll have to let him have your patrol car for tonight."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2976
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_060e0583:

    # oma "Corto y cierro."
    oma "Over and out."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2978
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_723ab410:

    # oma "Ya lo has oído, me tengo que ir."
    oma "You heard him, I have to go."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2979
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_dd3faeed:

    # mc "Ya, el deber es lo primero. No te preocupes, ya me quedo yo con Kiara y Eileen."
    mc "Yeah, duty comes first. Don't worry, I'll take care of Kiara and Eileen."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2980
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_29c7394c:

    # oma "Llámame si hay algún problema. En cuanto acabe vendré, no me debería llevar más de 30 o 40 minutos..."
    oma "Call me if there are any issues. As soon as I'm done, I'll come over. It shouldn't take me more than 30 to 40 minutes..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2981
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_d441cc08:

    # mc "En 30 minutos ya no deberíamos estar aquí, no te preocupes. Y ya has oído a Eileen, su padre no volverá hasta medianoche."
    mc "In 30 minutes we shouldn't be here anymore, don't worry. And you heard Eileen, her father won't be back until midnight."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2982
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_31fcb459:

    # oma "De todas formas, llámame o escríbeme cuando estéis en casa. Me quedaré más tranquila. Yo te llamaré cuando acabe, por si aún estáis aquí."
    oma "Anyway, call me or text me when you are at home. I'll be more at ease. I'll call you when I'm done, in case you're still here."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2985
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_e3496bc5:

    # oma "Te quiero."
    oma "I love you."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2986
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_6616e794:

    # mc "Yo también te quiero."
    mc "I love you too."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2989
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_046d047e:

    # mc "Perfecto, te llamo luego."
    mc "Great. I'll call you later."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2990
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_56a81578:

    # oma "Hasta luego."
    oma "Talk to you later."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2992
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_41d397cb:

    # "Unos minutos después..."
    "A few minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2993
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_4734d7b5:

    # eil "¿Dónde está Alexia?"
    eil "Where's Alexia?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2994
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ba6bbf0d:

    # mc "La han llamado para un servicio de urgencia. Si no habéis terminado cuando lo acabe, volverá."
    mc "She got a call from the station for an emergency. If you haven't finished by the time she's done, she'll be back."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2996
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_600cdfd6:

    # mc "Una maleta hecha. ¿Os queda mucho?"
    mc "A suitcase done. Do you have much packing left to do?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2997
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_62eaf6c6:

    # eil "Yo casi he acabado, mi otra maleta ya está hecha y solo me falta cerrarla. Voy a ayudar a mi madre con las suyas."
    eil "I'm almost done, my other suitcase is done and I just need to close it. I'm going to help my mother with hers."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:2998
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_75d335e2:

    # mc "¿Queréis ayuda?"
    mc "Do you need any help?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3000
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_2c55182e:

    # eil "No te preocupes, entre las dos acabaremos rápido. No creo que a mi madre le gustara que hurgaras entre su ropa interior."
    eil "Don't worry, between the two of us we'll finish quickly. I don't think my mother would like you rummaging through her underwear."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3001
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_923db28a:

    # mc "Ermmm..."
    mc "Ermmm..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3003
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ecdeef43:

    # eil "*Risa* ¡Y no hagas ninguna broma sobre meterte en sus bragas, que te conozco!"
    eil "*Laugh* And don't make any jokes about getting into her panties, I know you!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3004
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_ef344348:

    # mc "Maleta cargada. Solo quedan tres más."
    mc "A suitcase in the pickup. Only three more are left."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3005
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_20af0adf:

    # mc "No iba a hacer ninguna broma... Y no me des ideas. *Risa*"
    mc "I wasn't going to make any jokes.... And don't give me any ideas. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3007
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_f296a3d2:

    # eil "¿Lo estás diciendo en serio?"
    eil "Are you serious?"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3008
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_7c61d712:

    # mc "Por supuesto, que sí."
    mc "Of course, yes."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3009
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_116e1bbc:

    # mc "No iba a hacer ninguna broma. *Risa*"
    mc "I wasn't going to make any jokes. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3011
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_d9f8a862:

    # eil "No, idiota. Estoy hablando en serio. Lo de tener ideas con mi madre."
    eil "No, you idiot. I'm being serious. About having ideas with my mother."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3012
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_563efdbb:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡No! No se me ha ocurrido nunca. Tan solo te seguía la broma."
    mc "What? No! The idea never crossed my mind. I was just following your joke."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3014
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_c175e4d2:

    # eil "Casi me habías asustado... después del beso de antes..."
    eil "You almost scared me... after that kiss earlier..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3015
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_2958262e:

    # mc "Me ha besado porque la has puesto entre la espada y la pared, no porque quisiera."
    mc "She kissed me because you put her between a rock and a hard place, not because she wanted to."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3016
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_250e2188:

    # mc "Y ha sido el beso menos sensual que me han dado nunca... hasta el de Tía Betty ha sido mejor. *Risa*"
    mc "And it was the least sensual kiss I've ever had... even Aunt Betty's was better. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3018
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_41ab5b18:

    # kia "¿Hasta una monja besa mejor que yo? Tendré que mejorar eso. *Risa* ¿Y por qué te has asustado, Eile? Solo ha sido un beso."
    kia "Even a nun kisses better than me? I'll have to improve on that. *Laugh* And why did you freak out, Eile? It was just a kiss."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3020
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_5344fdd4:

    # eil "Por nada... [mc] ha hecho una broma sobre tu ropa interior y..."
    eil "It's nothing... [mc] made a joke about your underwear and..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3021
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_8e155502:

    # mc "¡Pero si yo no he llegado a decir nada!"
    mc "But I didn't say anything!"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3023
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_6926ab84:

    # eil "¡Vale, tú no has dicho nada! Me he montado yo sola la película en la cabeza... Pero imaginaros juntos..."
    eil "Okay, you didn't say anything! I wrote the whole tale in my head... But to imagine you together..."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3025
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_878dee2e:

    # kia "*Risa* ¿Qué? ¿[mc] y yo juntos? ¡Después la loca soy yo! *Risa* Espero que no me estés retando como con el beso."
    kia "*Laugh* What? [mc] and I together? And you say I'm the crazy one?! *Giggle* I hope you're not challenging me like you did with the kiss."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3026
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_83156cd5:

    # mc "*Risa* No sé si sentirme ofendido ahora mismo."
    mc "*Chuckle* I don't know whether to be offended right now."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3028
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_c5acc1c8:

    # kia "No me refiero a eso, cielo. ¿Qué ibas a hacer tú con una mujer como yo, con todos los problemas que hay en mi vida ahora mismo? *Risa*"
    kia "That's not what I meant, sweetie. What would you do with a woman like me, with all the problems that are going on in my life right now? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3029
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_fd47b3ec:

    # mc "Ayudarte a resolverlos, por supuesto. *Risa*"
    mc "Help you solve them, of course. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3032
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_bfff1ac2:

    # kia "No me extraña que le echaras el lazo en cuanto volvió, Eile. Siempre tiene la respuesta adecuada para todo."
    kia "No wonder you lassoed him as soon as he came back, Eile. He always has the right answer for everything."

# game/scripts/c15/c15.rpy:3034
translate english c15s007_KiaraHouse_d7f0cc96:

